<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="toc1">MRK - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">MRK - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">MRK - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt2">The Gospel according to</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mark</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yɔɔna ne su aneshir ne na ankɔŋ aŋyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Waŋa ayi ilɛ didik netu ayi Yesɔ Kristi, Izu Arik.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Icɛr yi Ishaya ine bla shar yi Arik tedi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">&lt;&lt;M tei shar ine shar amuŋ te abɛ lii zhin ti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">Iwaŋ ndi atei na ankɔŋ aŋyak zhin&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />&lt;&lt;Ikɔr nuŋ izhɔ rɛ ahwaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">&lt;Na zhin ankɔŋ nyak zhin Ŋgɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">Nab zhin ankɔŋɔ nyak anenen.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Fena Yɔɔna ne nyɛ re zizik, te su aneshir tena du lɛ kǝ Arik. netu ayi su aner abɛ duŋ na zumimin tǝ ta zuk zhɔk ne lalɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Bɔbɔk ne ŋa kɛ Yahuda bǝn aneshir abǝ Urshelima bɔbɔk ne na gar bǝn abɔu. Abla zumimin men, te Yɔɔna ne su ba ne nek ine Urdu <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yɔɔna ne su kluŋklu iyi na ne fumfuk kpa yi lakurmi, bǝn ririk kɛ na ne lɛda kɛ kpa ne tiŋ, tena ta Adagbyaŋ bǝn ntun anisho. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Fena waŋa ai nkanlɛ iyi du maa: &lt;&lt;Inuŋ atei nyɛ ne goŋ muŋ tena ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ anaŋ me, ndi Juda ayi akpaza amaa bam ne mla ne zuge yir ba. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Mǝ suu zhin ne amashir, ama ine nyɛmɛ atei su zhin ne Izhu Tsetser.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isu ben iten yi Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Nǝ mkpaŋ yuŋɔ Yesɔ ne rɛ Nazara kɛ Galili te duŋ Yɔɔna suu ne nek ne Urdu. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ndi Yesɔ anaga aru are miŋ amashire, akɔ yik gbarshu ku bu alɛla fena Izhu tsetser kuzi nyɛ sɔŋu ne mpa ndi angu. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Ankyak ikɔr ku rɛ gbarshu te di: &lt;&lt;Iwa uyi Zumuŋ, iwaŋ ndi Me nyeru; iwa susun muŋ inyɛru ngɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Ne amkpama, Izhu tsetser akɔ gli Yesɔ kɔmɔ ne ahwaŋ, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />te baŋ mkpaŋ ne ahwaŋa iber sɔknas, shetan azǝn tenu. Neyi amɔ ne ahwaŋa abiŋ bǝn inarum abɛ ŋlɔk aner, ne yiŋɛ abɛ shar ayou Arik ne zen lɔgu ma.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ nɛ zhɔ abǝ zeu na ndum abǝ kuti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ndi neka zhɔk Yɔɔna ne jaru, Yesɔ alɔ gar Galili, te du ilɛ didik kɛ Arik. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />&lt;&lt;Mkpaŋ neka nyɛ,&gt;&gt; Yesɔ adi ba. &lt;&lt;Mkpaŋ ne ka nyɛ. kɔb Arik ne gbahir! Duŋ na zumimin min te tanyɛmɛ ne ilɛ didik!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Ndi Yesɔ atsǝnetsǝn ne ŋa kɛ Inǝk ne Galili, ayik Siman ben izumen Anduru azǝn tyak burgi ne inege, ayi aneshir abɛ vu ambɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ zhin, zǝme azhin,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;te M tei duŋ zhin yi abɛ gli aneshir nyɛ ben abɛm.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ne amkpama akɔ duŋ tyak burgi te zǝ Yesɔ.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ndi ne ayene kɔmɔ ne ti, ate yik Yakubu izu Zebɛdi bǝn izumen Yɔɔna ne miŋ igu, azǝn ŋla burgi amen. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yik abɛ na ndum maa akɔ zhɔ ba, ankyak aduŋ tetɛɛ amen Zebɛdi ne igu bǝn aneshir abaŋ ndi ne baŋ ba na ndum kɛ yaa te zi Yesɔ.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ayar anerim arumɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Ane Yesɔ bǝn abɛ tsene maa ne kɔmɔ ne Kafanahum, ndi bɛr yi sɔŋ sik ne nyɛ, Yesɔ ne yir miŋ akaba te zen tsar amɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Aneshire ne vuŋ anu ne tsar maa, te atsar ne mgbyamgbyaŋ, ba ndi abɛ bla tsar nkanlɛ iyi cɛr Musa ba. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Ne yaŋa iner nuŋ ne akaba ŋɔ ne men yi ne izhu yi shetan ne miŋ kpa maa azhɔk zhin, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />Yesɔ awɔnǝ Nazara! &lt;&lt;Uwɔb anii bene bɛtai, Une nyɛ te ubǝ nyɛ zhɔk ta dɔmɔi? M ne zhi ka uyi ŋɔwa, Uyi Tsetser ne shar ayou Arik!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesɔ atsaŋ izhu mɔ ne amkpama te di,&lt;&lt;Kwɔnu!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ru ne kpa kɛ ner waŋa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Izhu yi shetan lǝk ner ndi ayi ne kpa maa abaŋa ŋur ne mimi te ŋɔr aru ne kpa kɛ neshire.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Fe aneshir bɔbɔk avuŋ anu tɛ bǝn arib akpa mɛn te di, &lt;&lt;Waŋa aye nii? Itsar yayas, ina yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ! Ana lɛ bǝn izhu yi shetan akɔ zǝ lɛ maa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Ilɛ kɛ bla ki na Yesɔ ne yir ntuntun iyi ŋa kɛ Galili ngɔŋ andanda.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ nena aner tetɛk te ne rɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ndi anaga duŋ akaba ŋɔ, akɔ gli Yakubu ben Yɔɔna te gar kɔb ane Siman ben Anduru. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Ne te yik acimen ayou Siman ikpa ne ŋuru zhɔk te akɔkur, ankyak akɔ bla Yesɔ ilɛ kǝ nǝ lɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Fena Yesɔ akɔte yigu akɔkur, avuŋ ŋɔk maa te abɛ alu asɔŋ. Ankyak akɔ rɛ te lɔgu ma.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ikab amgbalu ne bǝn aneshir ne vu abɛ lɔ bǝn abaŋ ndi anerim ne yir ba te nyɛ bǝn Yesɔ tǝ bɛ naa ba. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Ankyak aner abɛ ntuno bɔbɔk atuŋ akpa abiŋ amkpa zhin ne ankɔŋ ane yir ntuno, <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />fe Yesɔ nena aner abɛ lɔ kaŋkaŋ tetɛk te duŋ ba rɛ. Tena yar anerim aglɛ rumɔ; nena yar anerim bu anu te lɛ, tǝ nɛ zhiu.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne ben Arik ne amkpa nuŋ kiki maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Ndi bɛr bane zen ŋan klɛ ba, Yesɔ atsɛru te duŋ kɔb kǝ sɔŋ maa te kɔmɔ ne goŋ ntun te gar ben Arik. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Ankyak Siman ben nki abɛ zeu tsǝn alu zǝ goŋ maa, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />ndi ne te yigu, akɔ diu, aneshir tetɛk azǝne wɔb bu.<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Fe Yesɔ akɔ diba, &lt;&lt;tsara zhin kɔmɔ ne ntuntun yi ti, tem ite du lɛ kɛ Arik amɔ: te waŋa ayi ki ndi mne nyɛ naima.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Neme Yesɔ ne du lɛ Arik ne akaba amene ne ntuntun iyi Galili, te yar anerim aglɛ rumɔ ne akpa aner abaŋ ndi ne yir ba.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne na ner ne lɔ amkpuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Amɔ iner ne lɔ amkpuk nuŋ azǝ Yesɔ agar, te benu, tena tar agbarum, te di Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;utǝ ta Iben muŋ, ubɛ duŋ me rɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Fena Yesɔ akɔ wɔ lɔ susun maa, te sagu ŋɔk, te diu, &lt;&lt;Mne ta nyɛmɛ, ubǝ rɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Andanda ilɔ amkpuk go iduŋu, fe akɔ rɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yesɔ akɔ gbaŋu atɔŋ tedi ne kɔr ŋgɔŋ te duŋu akɔmɔ; <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Ankyak adiu &lt;&lt;Duŋ bla ner nuŋ ikinuŋ ba. kɔmɔ kimi, kɔ te tsar tu mi bǝn ine na ndum kǝ Arik, tena nek ikinuŋ iyi tsar nyɛr mi ne akabakɔŋ ndi icɛr yi Musa ne di duŋ bɛ yik uyi tsetser.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Bane yi amɛ ba, ne ru te zen du ilɛ kɛ Arik ne zhɔk kpa. Iki ndi ne zi goŋɔ, Yesɔ bane yir miŋ ntuno ne zhɔk kpa ba te kǝr aneshir abɛ yigu ba ama ne sɔŋ ne mkpǝmkpa iyi goŋ ntun. Neme aneshir kɔte amɛ akyak te azǝn zeu gar.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ nena ine lɔ amkpuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Fena ndi muɔ bɛr ne te, fe Yesɔ akama kɔmɔ ne Kafanahum, ankyak aneshir ne yik tedi ne ka kama nyak kɔb. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Ndi amɛ aneshir tetɛk akɔ tuŋ abiŋ te iki kɛ baŋ ba bɔbɔk ba yime ba, te ben abɛ klɛ ne abɛm ne anɔkɔŋ, fe Yesɔ adu lɛ didik kɛ Arik. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Aner anuŋ ne gli ine lɔ waŋ ndi ŋa kpa maa ne ku aner anas ahruu. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ndi bane yik amkpa ane gliu yire ba ne idu aneshir, akɔ baŋu te yuŋ tu adǝdak ayi miŋ kime te rus kɛ te baŋu ne ririk abiŋ ne ki kur maa asu azhɔk anenen ne amkpa awaŋ ndi Yesɔ ayime. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yik itanyɛmɛ men, akɔdi ne lɔmɔ, &lt;&lt;Vǝvǝn, ne zugu zhɔk ne zumimin mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Fena anuŋ abɛ tsar nkanlɛ yi cɛr Musa akɔsɔŋ ne amkpama, alɛ ne susun ne akpa mɛn te di, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />&lt;&lt;Anii duŋ ineshir waŋa alɛ mei? Alalɛ kɛ yiŋ Arik! Ai ŋɔwa ne amla ne zugu zhɔk ne zumimin mba Arik wa kiki maa ka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Andanda Yesɔ akɔ zhi ne susun maa te waŋa ayi iki duŋ ba alɛ ne susun amene, ankyak Yesɔ akɔ diba, &lt;&lt;Izhin lǝlɛ kɛ anii ne iki yiŋɛ? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Itayi naŋ: te abɛdi ine lɔ ku ŋa kpa, &lt;Ne zugu zhɔk ne zumimin mi, kɔ abɛ di, &lt;Lu, baŋ atakpa mi te tsǝn? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Neme te izhin bɛ zhi te Izu Neshir ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ne gɔnmimi kɛ zugu zhɔk ne zumimin.&gt;&gt; Yesɔ adi ne lɔ ŋa kpama, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />&lt;&lt;Mdiu, lu, baŋ ki kur mi te kɔmɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Akɔ lu, abaŋ ki kur maa te agar aru ne ayi amen bɔbɔk. Iyiŋɛ ne duŋ aneshir asak aŋɔk nenu te gbar Arik sak, tedi, &lt;&lt;Bata ne zen yik ikinuŋ ndi iyiŋɛ ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne zhɔ Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesɔ nena ru akɔmɔ ne kɔtɔŋ lelɔ nek. Idu aneshir ne zeu agar, akɔ vuŋ tsar ba. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ndi ne duŋ ba teyi kiki maa, ayik Lawi izu Alfa akɔsɔŋ ne vǝn iki kɛ ta gendu. Yesɔ akɔ diu, &lt;&lt;Lu zǝm,&gt;&gt; fe Lawi akɔ lu te zeu.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Ndi Yesɔ ne zen li ikili ne kɔb kɛ Lawi, aneshir abɛ na ndum ta gendu bǝn &lt;&lt;abɛ na zumimin&gt;&gt; azǝn li kili bene bɔu ndɔ ben abɛ tsene maa bǝn aneshir tetɛk abɛ zen zeu. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Abɛ tsar cɛr iyi Musa abaŋ ndi ntsan Ferisawa anuŋ ayik Yesɔ azǝn li kili ben &lt;&lt;abɛ na zumimin&gt;&gt; bǝn abɛ ta gendu, arib abɛ tsene maa: &lt;&lt;Anii duŋu zhiin li kili ben abɛ ta gendu te vuŋ abɛ na zumimin?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Inak wɔ iyiŋɛ, Yesɔ akɔ diba, &lt;&lt;Bai ner ne ikpa keke wa awɔb ner ne nek kǝka ba, ayi waŋ ndi alɔ. Bam ne nyɛ zhɔ abɛ tsetser ba, ama abɛ na zumimin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne rib Yesɔ lɛ kɛ kpa anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Ne mkpaŋ nuŋ abɛ tsene abɛ Yɔɔna tsen bǝn Ferisawa ne kpa anu. Aner anuŋ ne nyɛ te rib Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Anii iyi duŋ abɛ zǝ Yɔɔna tsǝn ben Ferisawa akpa anu, ama amie ba akpa anu kai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Aner abaŋ ndi igyaŋ iyi ne kɔb men ai na kikin te kpa anu ndi ne ta iwa ma ayi bene ba ne amkpa ne kpa ŋama? Bai te ba, ire mkpaŋ keŋ ndi atei yi bene ba. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Fena mkpaŋ tei nyɛ ndi atei baŋ ne ta iwa ma agli atibe bene ba, fe ne bǝn atei ka kpa anu.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />&lt;&lt;Ba nuŋ atei gbu anklu ayayas aŋa te ahwɛn anyaŋ biŋ bǝn acicɛ anklu ba. Ate na amɛ, ŋa yaya sa itei gbaŋ ciceme gbuŋa, igbuŋa maa itei yi mimin. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Neme inuŋ batei shur ancen ayayas ne cice gwara ba. Ate shurɔ, acɛ nɛ atei wun teduŋ gwarama alakakna aŋar, fe iya mǝne atei var ahrie igwara ma iteina gbuŋa. Ashur ama ayayas ne kǝken yayas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ayi Arik ane bɛr yi sɔŋ sik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Nǝ bɛr yi sɔŋ sik nuŋ Yesɔ agara zǝ ahwaŋ ndi ne tib alikama, abɛ tsene maa atsǝne zeu, akɔ mlik atɔ nuŋ. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Ferisawa akɔ diu, &lt;&lt;Tɔ, ayi nii duŋu abɛ tsene mi ana ki mimin yiŋ ndi iglak ilɛ kɛ cɛr yi Musa ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesɔ asaga, Ba zhin ne wɔ iki yiŋ ndi Doda ane nai ben abɛ tsǝn amaa ikasa ne vuŋ ba te ne wɔb kili ka?<verse eid="MRK 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Nǝ mkpaŋ kɛ Abiyata ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik, ne yir min akabankɔŋ ayou Arik tǝ ta borodi tena nek abɛ tsǝn amaa, irkeŋ ndi imenyi ana ki mimin kɛ abɛ na ndum ne akabakɔŋ ankyak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Tena diba,&lt;&lt; Nena neshir iber yi sɔŋ sik, ba nena bɛr yi sɔŋ sik netu ayi ineshir ba. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Fena Izu Neshir ayi Ŋgɔŋ netu ayi bɛr yi sɔŋ sik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Nǝ bɛr nuŋ Yesɔ ne kɔmɔ ne akabankɔŋ, fe iner nuŋ waŋ ndi iŋɔk maa ne vugun ayi muɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Anuŋ ne miŋ mǝne awɔb ankɔŋ ane vuŋ Yesɔ ne lalɛ, ne suu ayi ŋgɔŋ te aba abɛ yik kai di wa atei na aneshire tǝ bɛ rɛ ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesɔ adi neshir nǝ gun ŋɔk go, &lt;&lt;Lu klɛ ne ti aneshir abaŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Ankyak Yesɔ akɔ rib ba tedi, &lt;&lt;Itayi iyi anenen. Nǝ bɛr yi sɔŋ sik: abɛ na iki didik ka abɛ na ki mimin, abɛ ta ivli azhɔk ineshir ka abɛ ŋun ni?&gt;&gt; Ama bane di kinuŋ ba.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Akama tɔ ba ne ti kɛ mfu, ne te mfu ŋgɔŋ ne klik asusun mǝne, adi iner ne gun ŋɔgo, Ubǝ nab ŋɔgo.&gt;&gt; Neshire anab kɛ, ankyak ŋɔk maa iku nab. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Fe Ferisawa akɔ ru abɛm te zen kpa nyak ben aner abɛ Hiridus ir keŋ ndi aba atei na te abɛ ŋun Yesɔ.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntsan aneshir azǝ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesɔ ne kama ru ben abɛ tsene maa te gar kɔtɔŋ nek, fe ntsan aneshir abɛ rɛ Yahudiya ben Galili, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Urshelima, ben ntun yi Idɔm, ben ntuntun yi ŋa kɛ Juda ben Taya ben Sidon, aner tetɛk ne te tun ne zeu ndi ne wɔ kiki yiŋɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Ndi ne yik idu aneshire abla abɛ tsene maa abe te wɔb igu vǝtsɔb aŋyak wa, te wa abɛ tɛ shaan ne du aneshir. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Te ne na aneshir tetɛk te ne rɛ, te duŋ abɛ yine lɔ kaŋkaŋ azǝn tur te aba abɛ sagu ŋɔk.<verse eid="MRK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Mkpaŋ keŋ ndi anerim ne yigu, azhaku ne ti maa te aŋar zhin, &lt;&lt;Uyi Izu Arik.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Neme anǝk ba ilɛ ŋgɔŋ te kǝr abɛ bla nuŋ ka iwa ayi ŋɔwa ba.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne hria abɛ zeu na ndum awur ane yaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yesɔ ne kama yuŋ tu gbu te zhɔ abaŋ ndi wa ne ta nyɛmɛ bene ba, te duŋ ba te yigu amɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Ne hria aner awur aneyaa tedi aba aye abɛ tsene maa te abǝ na ndum maa te bena yi abɛ du lɛ kɛ Arik <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />te bena yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ yar anerim gli rumɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Waŋa aye aneshir awur ane yaa abɛ hria amaa: Siman (iwaŋ ndi ne nǝgu sak te Biturus); <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakubu izu Zebɛdi ben izumen ane Yɔɔna (Yesɔ ne zhɔ ba te Buwanazhi, watɔ Amumun abɛ nnas); <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Anduru, Filibus, Batɔlɔmi, Matiu, Tɔma, Yakub izu Alfa, Tadiyo, Siman ne nyere kpa <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ben Yahuda awɔnǝ Iskariyɔti ndi ne baŋ Yesɔ alɛb.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ben ngɔŋ ne anerim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Fe Yesɔ ayir kɔb, ankyak aneshir akɔ tuŋ abiŋ, ir keŋ ndi iwa ben abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa bane yik mkpaŋ kɛ li kili yir ba. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ndi aner kɔb abɛ Yesɔ ne wɔ ki ndi itsin, ne gar te aba abɛ vuŋu agli agar kɔb, te anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Itu maa ba yi anenen ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Ndi amɛ abɛ tsar ne nkanlɛ yi cɛr Musa abaŋ ndi ne zi anyɛ Urshelima adi, &lt;&lt;Ndar yi Belzebub itum ane anerim ivuŋu! ngɔŋ ane anerim tǝ ayar anerim aruu ma te aganci avuŋu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Neme Yesɔ azhɔ ba te blaa ba nkanlɛ: &lt;&lt;shetan ana kikin te yar shetan rumɔi? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ikɔb ngɔŋ te gab te ntǝk yaa, ikɔbɔ ba tei klɛ ba. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Aner abɛ miŋ kɔb bate biŋ atu ba; ikɔbɔ batei klɛ ba. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ate yi ndi shetan te kyak tu maa te ŋar te nten, batei klɛ ba; iklɛtu maa ne nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Ai lɛ didik, nuŋ batei yir kɔb kɛ neshir ne klik te kɔte baŋ kinuŋ maa te ru ba se ne kuti akpa ner ne klik ge baliŋ. Te kashe vu kiki iyi kɔbɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Mblazhin izub, ilalɛ bɔbɔk bǝn nkan lelɛ yi sha Arik atei zuk aner azhɔk blai. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Ama iwaŋ ndi ate tun zhi izhu yi Arik; ne lalɛ kǝ yaŋ klɛtu keŋ ndi ba tei zuk ilalɛ maa azhɔk ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesɔ adi amɛ te azǝn di &lt;&lt;Ayi ne anerim.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyah amaa Yesɔ ben amunzumen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Fe iyah amaa Yesɔ ben amunzumen ne tsǝne te yir. Te aklɛkli ne bɛm, akɔ shar nuŋ te abɛ zhɔu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Ntsan aneshir ne kamu azhɔk ne tsutsu te diu, &lt;&lt;Iya mi bǝn amunzumin bǝn amunvamin ayi ne bɛm azǝn wɔb bu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesɔ arib ba. &lt;&lt;Ayi ane ŋɔɔ ba yi iya muŋ ben amunzumɔrɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Akam atɔ abaŋ ndi akɔsɔŋ agankyaŋa tedi, &lt;&lt;Abaŋa aye ne iya muŋ ben amunzumɔr!<verse eid="MRK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Iwaŋ ndi ate naki ndi Arik adi ai wa ayi zumɔr ben vamɔr ben iya muŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Nkanlɛ netu ner ine tib bǝbǝ ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Neme Yesɔ atsar ba ne kɔtɔŋ nek. Ntsan aneshir ndi ne kamu azǝk ne atsutsumɔ ayi ne du te duŋu a yir miŋ igu asɔŋɔ te zen tsar ba ndi ne zǝ sɔŋ ne kɔtɔŋ nek ne Galili te zen wɔu. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Ne tsar ba kiki tetɛk ne nkanlɛ, fe ne miŋ kɛ tsar maa idi: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />&lt;&lt;Wɔ zhin! Iner ne lɔn nuŋ ne gar tib bǝbǝ ki ne ahwaŋa amaa. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Ndi ayi ne min kɛ yi bǝbǝ kime, inuŋ var hrie ne ankɔŋ, fe aŋliŋlɔ anyɛ taŋǝ amli bɔbɔk. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Inuŋ var hrie ne ayaŋ, ndi mimi me ba yi tɔ ki ba. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ndi arik ne laŋ ŋgɔŋ, bǝbǝ ki iyi tibɛ ku goŋ cɔkla, te kam klu te ririŋe bane sɔŋ ne mimi didik ba. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Bǝbǝ kinuŋ var hrie ne min ncɔŋ, ndi ne tɔ, ncoŋ ku turǝ teduŋ bane te mgbyaŋ ba. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Neme bǝbenuŋ nena hrie ne mimi didik. Nǝ tɔ, te flu tena dɔ mgbyaŋ, inuŋ ne yi abubu sɔktar, sɔk tani, inuŋ ne naŋ amgblik azhin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Fena Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ate yi ne atɔŋ ayi wɔ, abɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Ndi Yesɔ neyi kiki maa, abɛ tsene maa awur ane yaa bǝn abaŋ ndi ne wɔu arib Yesɔ lɛ netu nkanlɛ yi bla maa. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesɔ abla ba tedi, &lt;&lt;Iki iyi suyir ne kɔb Arik nɛ nǝk zhin neyi. Ama abaŋ ndi ayi ne abɛm ne bla ba nkanlɛ yiŋɛ <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />te duŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">&lt;&lt;&lt;Tǝ abɛ tɔ ba tei yik ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">Tǝ bɛ na wɔ batei zhi ba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Mba amɛ atei ŋur akam tǝ Arik abɛ zuk ba zhɔk!&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Fena Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ba zhin ne zhi nkan lɛ yiŋɛ ka? Tǝ izhin tei na kikin te zhi nkanlɛ nuŋǝ? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Iner ne lɔno ne tib ilɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Aneshir anuŋ ayi ndi bǝbǝ ki yi tib iyiŋ ndi ne var hrie ne ankɔŋ, amkpa awaŋ ndi ne tib ilɛ mɛ. Ate naga wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik, shetan inyɛ te baŋ ilɛ kɛ Arik agli tibɛ ne asusun amen. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Anuŋ, ayi ndi bǝbǝ yi var hrie ne amkpa ane ayaŋ, ndi ne wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik te nyer. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Ama ba ilɛmɛ bane yir miŋ asusun amene ba, ba baŋ mkpaŋ ba. Ndi iwɔb akla bǝn isak iya ite nyɛ netu lɛ kɛ Arik, akɔ mǝne azhaku. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Neme anuŋ, ayi ndi bǝbǝ ki yiŋ ndi ne tibɛ ne miŋ ncɔŋ, abaŋ ndi ne wɔ ilɛ kɛ Arik, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ama imɔ yi sɔŋ kɛ gɔnmimi, ishur ayi ne kiki tik ayi bǝn adudunki bǝn itik ayi ne bubu netu kiki ndi nyɛ te cɔk ilɛ kɛ Arik ila, te duŋ kɛ yaŋ flu. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Anuŋ, ayi ndi bǝbǝ yi tib ne mimi didik, awɔ ilɛ kɛ Arik, ne tanyɛme ne kǝ, anuŋ ne yik abubu sɔk tar, sɔk tani kɔ bǝ naŋ amgblik azhin ne bǝbǝ ki yi tibɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitila ne tu mben iyi sɔŋ maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin baŋ pitila ku nyak ne sesa ka ne aza agodɔ ne mimi? Ndi amɛ, di ka izhin sak zhin Lu kɛ laŋa ne amkpadeb? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Tǝ ikiyiŋ ndi ne suyir atei bui ayak andala, ikiyiŋ ndi iyi raraŋ Arik atei buri arumɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Ate yi ndi inuŋ ayi ne atɔŋ ayi wɔ, abɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin bǝ te zee ne kiki iyi wɔ min,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Agbǝba awaŋ ndi izhin te tsar nuŋ kime, aye awa atei na tsa ru ma mi yi itei na gar kam. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Iner waŋ ndi ate yi ne ki atei na nyaŋu nuŋ ne tu mɔ; iwaŋ ndi ba yi ame neyi ba, kɔ vǝtsɔb yiŋ ndi ayime ne yi atei tei ne ŋɔk maa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkanlɛ bǝbǝ ki iyi tɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesɔ nena di, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi ir keŋ ndi kɔb Arik yime. Ineshir ne yi bǝbǝ ki ne mimi. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Akurna ne bu te sɔŋ tsitsir aririk, bǝbǝ me tɔ tena flu, neme ba zhi ka na kikin ba. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Imimi iduŋ bǝbǝ ki tɔ te flu te dɔ ikili, tɛ nab ŋkluŋ baliŋ, fe te lu ru atɔ, fe mgbyaŋ kpu ku ru. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Ndi ikiyi tibɛ neka rǝ mla sɛr, iner ne ahwaŋa atei baŋ alibzi amaa sɛrǝ, te mkpaŋ kɛ sɛrǝ ma nǝ ka tǝ. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkanlɛ ne atu bǝbǝ mgbyaŋ musta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Ankyak Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Ta tei di kɔb Arik iyi kikini, ka nkanlɛ tayi tei bla ndi kɔbɔ yi mei? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Iyi ndi bǝbǝ nklik, keŋ ndi iyi mgbyaŋ mɔtsɔtsɔb ne miŋ kɛ bǝbǝ ki iyi tib ne mimi. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Neme ate tib bǝbǝ me, itɔ te flu tena te ngɔŋ te kam naŋ nki bǝbǝ ki ndi ne tibɛ ne miŋ Ahwaŋ ne kam zib, te aŋliŋlɔ abɛ bwak ne gbarshu ashur anjer ne anga amaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesɔ ne lɛ ben abɛba ne nkan lelɛ tetɛk, neme bane nazhi iki yi bla ba. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Yesɔ bane bla ba lɛnuŋ keŋ ndi bane yaŋ ba nkanlɛ ba. Ama mkpaŋ keŋ ndi atei ndɔ ben abɛ tsene maa, ba ku kinuŋ ayir bama ba.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne tsaŋ nguŋgu tǝ nɛ te zee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Nǝ bǝn amgbalu neka te, abla abɛ zeu tsǝn te di, &lt;&lt;Duŋ zhin tabǝ glɔ kɔmɔ ne goŋ nek yuŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Akɔ duŋ aneshir, te tsǝn ndɔ ben Yesɔ, ir keŋ ndi abɛ nama, ne gar ayir mimin gumɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Ankyak nguŋgu ngɔŋ iye ankun amashir fuk gumɔ ŋgɔŋ ndi tei gbuŋa, ayi ndi igumɔ itei rim. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesɔ ne yi miŋ igumɔ ne gɔn te zen kurna te sak tu maa ne iki sak tu. Abɛ zeu tsǝn akɔte sǝu te di, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar, bau nǝ kam tɔ kɔ tabǝ dɔ ba&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Akɔ lu, te tsaŋ nguŋgumɔ tedi, &lt;&lt;Tǝ zee, Kǝr ubena fuk ba!&gt;&gt; Ankyak ankun amashire akɔ te zee.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yesɔ akɔ di abɛ zeu tsin amaa, &lt;&lt;Izhin te sisik iye nii? Har azizaŋa ba zhin yi ne tanyɛmɛ ka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Isisik ku te aneshire te ben arib akpa, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi ŋɔwai? Nak tɔ te vuŋ nguŋgu ben ankun amashir iwɔ lɛ maa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ne na ner ne yi ne anerim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesɔ ben abɛ zeu tsin ne glɔ goŋ nek ne Galili te gar igar kɛ Garisinawa. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Ndi Yesɔ ne ru ne miŋ gumɔ iner nuŋ ndi ayi ne anerim aru rɛ amkpa ane ru aneshir te anyɛ yigu. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Iner waŋa akur ne amkpa ne ru aneshir, inuŋ ba mla te abɛ kpau ne tsǝtsaŋ ba. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Nak men rɛ kukub akpau ne tsǝtsaŋ aŋɔk ben aza ama ana gbur atsǝtsaŋa akluk inuŋ ba yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ vuŋu gli ba. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Ibu bǝn aririk ne amkpa ne ru aneshir bǝn atu mkpaŋ a ŋarzhin te vu mkpaŋ aŋar kpa maa.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ndi ne yik Yesɔ gbagbaŋ, alu klu te tar agbarum ne ti maa. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Inere aŋar kɔr te di, &lt;&lt;Uwɔb anii bene bɛm, Yesɔ, Izu Arik Ŋgɔŋ me biŋu ben Arik duŋ sak me iyah ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Te Yesɔ ne adiu te di, &lt;&lt;ru ne kpa kɛ ner waŋa wa izhu mimin!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Fe Yesɔ aribu te di, &lt;&lt;azhɔu te ŋɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Adi, &lt;&lt;Azhɔm tǝ lǝjɔn, watɔ tetɛk, tǝ ta yine du.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Ankyak aben Yesɔ tena benu kǝr abɛ gli ba aru ne amkpa waŋa ba.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Ayok ntsan ane gluk abɛ kɔb tetɛk ne kɔn tiŋ gbu. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Ankyak anerime aben Yesɔ te di, &lt;&lt;shur ta ne miŋ ane gluk abɛ kɔb abaŋa te duŋ ta bǝ yir miŋ mǝne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Fe aduŋ ba aru, ankyak anerime akɔ ru te yir miŋ ane gluk abɛ kɔbɔ. Idu mǝne iyi azhin ayaa, ne ru ahrie ne miŋ nek ŋgɔŋ te mli amashir.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Abaŋ ndi a yɔk ane gluk abɛ kɔbɔ aklu te kɔte bla aneshir ne miŋ ntun ŋgɔŋ ben ntuntun mwɔtsɔtsɔb, ankyak aneshir akɔ ru te kɔte tɔ iki yiŋ ndi Yesɔ ne nai. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Ndi ne nyɛ bǝn Yesɔ, ne yik iner waŋ ndi azhɔu te lǝjɔn ndi anerim tetɛk ne yir kpa maa, akɔ sɔŋ ne su iki ne kpa maa alambur tu amaa ayi bǝn abɔu sisik ku vuŋ ba. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Abaŋ ndi ne yik ne ayi men ne bla ki yiŋ ndi ne vuŋ waŋ ndi anerim tetɛk ne yir kpa maa ben ki yiŋ ndi ne vuŋ ane gluk abɛ kɔbɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Fe aneshire akɔ ben Yesɔ abɛ duŋ gar mǝne.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Ndi Yesɔ ayi ne miŋ kɛ yir igu, iner waŋ ndi ane yi ne anerime aben te wa abɛ zeu. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yesɔ bane tanyɛme ba, ama diu, &lt;&lt;kɔmɔ te bla aner abɛ kɔmin ki yiŋ ndi Arik Ŋgɔŋ ne nau aneyi ben ir keŋ ndi ne lɔ susun mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Fe neshire akɔ ŋur akam akɔmɔ te zen bla ba ne Dikafoli kiki yiŋ ndi Yesɔ ne naa wa aneyi. Ankyak aneshir aku vuŋ anu.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne lɛk vǝnwa ne ku te na Wa ne lɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Ndi Yesɔ ne glɔ goŋ nek ngɔŋ ne igu, ntsan aneshir ne kamu zhɔk ne atsutsu ne goŋ nek. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Inuŋ ne miŋ kɛ angɔgɔŋ abɛ tsik ibaŋ ne akaba, azhɔu te Yarus, anyɛ amkpama. Ndi ne yik Yesɔ, te zhaku ne aza amaa <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />te benu ngɔŋ, &lt;&lt;Iva muŋ vǝtsɔb aku. Mbenu kɔte sagu aŋɔk te duŋu abɛ rɛ te bɛ yi tsitsir.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Fe Yesɔ akɔ zeu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:24">Ntsan aneshir azhɔgu ne atsutsu te mɔu. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Ankyak wa nuŋ ndi ne te ase awur ane yaa te zen zi azhizhi. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Nǝ yik iya tetɛk ne ŋɔk abɛ na kǝka te ŋlɔk ki yi ŋɔk maa, ndi abɛ rɛ ilɔmɔ ikyak te te ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Ndi ne wɔ lɛ ne tu Yesɔ, akama zǝ gɔŋ maa te sak ŋɔk ne anklu akɛ gen amaa, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />adi ne susun maa, &lt;&lt;Mte sak ŋɔk ne anklu amaa, M tei rɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Nǝ amkpamkpama iru azhizhi me igburkli ankyak iwama awɔ ne kpa maa wa ne ka li aru ne ya maa.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Nǝ amkpamkpama Yesɔ awɔ mgbyamgbyaŋ ne ru ne kpa maa. A kama tɔ ntsan aneshire te rib ba te di, &lt;&lt;Ayi ŋɔwa a sak ŋɔk ne anklu amuŋ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />abɛ tsene maa mtanyeme, &lt;&lt;Uyik ntsan aneshir ne kamu azhɔk ne atsutsu, urib te di ai ŋɔwa asagu ŋɔk?&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ama Yesɔ akyak te blɛ amkpa tɔ te iwa abɛ yik ayi ŋɔwa ne cɔk wa ŋɔk. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Fe iwama, ne zhi ki yiŋ ndi nena ne kpa maa, anyɛ te zhaku ne aza amaa ne rɛ kpa ben sisik te blau zub. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesɔ a diu, &lt;&lt;Va muŋ, itanyɛmɛ mi ne duŋu rɛ. kɔmɔ ne sik susun une li ru ne iyah mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Ndi Yesɔ anaga ri yi ne miŋ kɛ lɛ aneshir anuŋ are kɔb kɛ Yarus ngɔŋ ne akaba. A blau te di &lt;&lt;Va mi ne ku,&gt;&gt; U na wɔb Yesɔ ne nii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yesɔ bane kama tɔ kɛ yiŋ ndi ablai ba, adi ngɔŋ ne akaba ma, &lt;&lt;Duŋ te sisik ba nak tanyɛmɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yesɔ bane duŋ nuŋ azeu ba anaga yi ane Biturus, Yakubu ben Yɔɔna amunzumen ane Yakubu. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Ndi ne yir kɔb ngɔŋ ne akaba ma, Yesɔ awɔ yaa atɔŋ aneshir azǝn zhin ngɔŋ. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Yesɔ ayir miŋ kɔbɔ te di ba, &lt;&lt;aye nii duŋ zhin ya tɔŋ te zhin amɛ? Vǝvǝne bane ku ba ayi tsitsir.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ankyak amlagu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Ndi ne yar ba rumɔ bɔbɔk, aduŋ Tetɛɛ me ben iyah maa vǝvǝne ben abɛ zeu tsǝn ndi ayi bene bɔu, te yir amkpa waŋ ndi vǝvǝne akɔkurɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesɔ avuŋ ŋɔk maa te di vǝŋɔ &lt;&lt;Talita kum!&gt;&gt; Kǝŋ ilɛmɛ di, &lt;&lt;Vǝnwa vǝtsɔb, mdi lu sɔŋ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ne amkpamkpama vǝnwama alu klɛ te tsǝn (ayi ase wur ane yaa.) Ki yi na maa duŋ ba vuŋ anu. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yesɔ ne di ba kǝr abɛ duŋ bla nuŋ ki yiŋɛ ba tena diba abɛ nugu kili ata li.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Nǝ bla shar Arik ndi ba yik tɔ shak ayi ne itun maa ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesɔ ne duŋ amɔ te kɔmɔ ne ntun maa, abɛ tsene maa ne ku gɔŋ <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Ndi bɛr yi sɔŋ sik ne nyɛ, Yesɔ ne tsar ba ne akabankɔŋ, aneshir tetɛk ndi ne wɔu ne vuŋ anu. Arib te di,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:2">&lt;&lt;Iner waŋa ne yik kiki yiŋɛ neme? Nǝ yik Mgbemgbeb kǝŋe ne mee? ndi azǝn na kiki yi vuŋ anu! <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ba waŋa ayi izu ne kpaŋ ki kai? Ba wa ayi zu Meryamu bǝn izumen ane Yakubu, Yusuu, Yahuda ben Siman kai? Ba ye amunvamen ayi ben abɛta kai?&gt;&gt; Fe akɔ baŋ afuk bene bau.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesɔ di ba,&lt;&lt;Anǝk ine bla shar yi Arik ŋgon maa kɔte me anaga ayi ne ntun maa, ben aneshir amaa ben kɔb maa kɛ ba nǝgu ŋgon ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Ba ne na ikinuŋ yi vuŋ anu amuɔ ba, ne anaga sak aneshir abɛ lɔ aŋɔk te duŋ ba arɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yesɔ ne vuŋ anu ne yaŋ tanyɛmɛ mǝne.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesɔ ne shar abɛ zeu na ndum awur ane yaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Ankyak Yesɔ azǝ ntuntun te zen tsar. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Azho awur ne yaa, te shar ba aya yaa te nek ba mgbyamgbyaŋ ne tu anerim.<verse eid="MRK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Waŋa ayi lɛ kɛ nek maa: &lt;&lt;Kǝr zhin bǝ baŋ ki nuŋ gli ne tsǝn min ba, nak gli zhin mkpɔki kɛ tsǝn, kǝr zhin bǝ gli kili ba, bǝn mgbɔ, ben azɔb ne kpamin. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Abɛ su akpaza kǝr abɛ gli kiki yi su ba. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Izhin te yir kɔb nuŋ, izhin bǝ sɔŋ amɔ se mkpaŋ keŋ ndi zhin ne duŋ ntuno. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Itun yiŋ ndi ba te ta zhin te wɔ zhin ba, izhin bǝ klu mgbumgbuk yi aza min shur ndi zhin te ru, te bǝ yi ba iki yi shu zhi ne atu amen.<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Ne ru te zen du lɛ kɛ Arik te aneshir abɛ duŋ zumimin men <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Ne gli anerim tetɛk agli arumɔ te kin aneshir tetɛk anyɛ te duŋ ba ne rɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iku kɛ Yɔɔna ne su aneshir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Itum Hiridus ne wɔ ki yiŋɛ, isak kɛ Yesɔ ne zhi kɛ ngɔŋ. Anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Yɔɔna ne su aneshir ne lu ne bɛ, waŋa yi ki yiŋ ndi kiki yi vuŋ anu zen na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Ayi Iliya.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Anuŋ adi &lt;&lt;Ayi ine bla shar yi Arik, ne min kɛ abɛ bla lɛ kɛ Arik kukub.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Fe ndi Hiridus ne wɔ mee, adi, &lt;&lt;Yɔɔna, waŋ ndi mne duŋ akyaŋ tu maa, ayi wa ne lu ne bɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Hiridus ne tu maa ne nek anu te di abɛ vuŋ Yɔɔna, te wa abɛ kpau te ku ne jaru. Ne na me ne tu yi Hirudiya, iwa zumen Filibus waŋ ndi ne tau. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Yɔɔna ne mǝne bla Hiridus te di,&lt;&lt; Ba ne rɛ te abɛ ta Iwa zumen ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Fe hirudiya azǝn Gli Yɔɔna ne susun te wɔb ankɔŋ ane ŋunu. Ama bane yik ankɔŋɔ ba, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />te Hiridus aklu sisik Yɔɔna te zen kamu zǝk, ne zhi ayi ner ne klu sisik Arik te na yi ner tsetser. Ndi Hirudus ne wɔ lɛ kɛ Yɔɔna ayi ne mɔ, susun maa ne cɔk la; neme ne wɔb te wa abɛ wɔu.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ndi mkpaŋ ne te. Iber yi ŋli maa ne kam nyɛ Hiridus ne naa atum angɔŋgɔŋ ben amɔtsɔtsɔb ben angɔŋgɔŋ aneshir abɛ Galili igyaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Ndi va Hirudiya ne yir te glu, ne duŋ susun kɛ Hiridus ben angɔŋgɔŋ aneshir anyɛr.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:22">Itum adi vǝnwama, &lt;&lt;Ben me iki yiŋ ndi uwɔbǝ, M tei nǝgu neyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Anegu anu te sherim, &lt;&lt;Iki yiŋ ndi utǝ wɔbǝ me tei nǝgu yi kɔ ate yi ndi ayi ŋa ikɔb kǝ gli muŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Vǝvǝn iwa ma aru te di yaa maa, &lt;&lt;Mǝ ben anii?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Atanyeu ma te di,&lt;&lt;Itu kɛ Yɔɔna ne su aneshir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Aŋur akam andanda ate yik itum te di: &lt;&lt;Mǝ wɔb te ubǝ nǝm itu Yɔɔna ne su aneshir ne miŋ agbǝgba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Susun kɛ itum ne cokla, ama arim ayiŋ ndi ne shei bǝn angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ gyaŋ maa bane tanyɛmɛ te wa abɛ yazhiu ma ba. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Andanda itum akɔ shar ne blɛu tedi abɛ kɔte gli itu kɛ Yɔɔna agli nyɛmɛ. Ineshire akɔ kɔmɔ, te kɔte kyaŋ tu Yɔɔna ne jaru, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />akɔte gli tu kɛ Yɔɔna te nyɛ ne agbǝgba. Itum ata kɛ anǝk va maa, ivǝnwa ma ata kɛ anǝk iya maa. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Ndi abɛ zǝ Yɔɔna na ndum ne wɔ mee, anyɛ baŋ ikum maa akɔte ru ne amkpa ane ru akum.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ne yɔk aneshir azhin atuŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin ne ŋur akam aya yaa te nyɛ kamu azǝk ne tsutsu te blau ki yiŋ ndi aba nenai ben yiŋ ndi aba ne tsarǝ <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Fe, aneshir tetɛk azǝn nyɛ te kɔmɔ ba yik mkpaŋ kɛ li ki li ba,Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ zhin bene bɛm ne tu min ne amkpa ane yaŋ ya atɔŋ ne zizik te sɔŋ sik zhin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ankyak akɔ te yir igu ne tu men te kɔmɔ ne amkpa awaŋ ndi aneshir ba yime ba. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ama aneshir tetɛk ndi ayik ba zhi aneshir aklu ne za a rɛ ntuntun te ku ba ti. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yir te yik ntsan aneshir, ne wɔ lɔ susun mǝne, ayi ndi awanta abaŋ ndi ba yi ne iner ne kyu ba ba. Fe akɔ vuŋ tsar ba ikiki tetɛk.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Nǝ mkpaŋa arik neka ku, fe abɛ tsene maa ne anyɛ bene bɔu. &lt;&lt;Amkpa waŋa ayi zizik, arik ne ka ku. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Duŋ aneshir akɔmɔ te gar ntuntun iyi gbahir te yir miŋ ntun te lɛb atu amen kili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Ama a tanyɛme te di, &lt;&lt;Nek zhine ba kili.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Adiu te di, &lt;&lt;Iyiŋ ndi atei ŋun azɔb ayi mla ya neshir ne na ndum ndi tei yi ihwa tender! Te ta bǝ ŋlɔk azɔb ne ki li te nek ba ta li?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesɔ arib &lt;&lt;Ambwab borodi aben ayi ben abɛ zhin?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;kɔte tɔ zhin&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Ndi ne kɔte tɔ, adi, &lt;&lt;Ambwab borodi atuŋ ben ambɛ ayaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Fe Yesɔ adi ba abɛ duŋ aneshir bɔbɔk abɛ zǝ sɔŋ ntsetsen ne agǝga ashushu. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Ankyak ne sɔŋ ntsǝtsen anuŋ amkplik azhi zhiin anuŋ sɔk tutuŋ <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />A baŋ ambwab borodi atuŋ ben ambɛ yaa te lɛge agli tɔ gbarshu, te nyer Arik te muŋ mbwab borodime. Fe te nek abɛ tsene maa ne ti kɛ aneshir. Yesɔ ne gab ba ambɛ amɛ ayaa ma bɔbɔk. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Ne li bɔbɔk mǝne te hri, <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />ankyak abɛ tsin amaa ne vu sisa amɛ wur ane yaa te vu nki borodi ben ambɛ me. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Idu alulum abaŋ ndi ne li kili me ne yi azhin atuŋ.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ne tsǝn ne atu amashir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Andanda Yesɔ ne duŋ abɛ tsene maa ayir igu te kuti akɔmɔ ne Batseda, teshe duŋ aneshir a kɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ndi Yesɔ ne duŋ ba, ne yuŋ tu gbu te ben Arik.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ndi amgbalu neka te, igumɔ iyi ne atsutsu nek, Yesɔ ayi ne tu gbu iwa kiki maa. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Yesɔ ayik abɛ tsene maa azǝn yik iya ne den gumɔ, nguŋgu zen te zor ben abɛba. Nǝ agbak atuk nyɛ ŋan bɛr Yesɔ aru te gar ben abɛba. Nǝ na ndi atei gayir te duŋ ba, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />ama ndi ne yik Yesɔ ne tsǝtsen ne amashir, ayik te di ayi ner ne ku ru akɔ zhɔk tsaŋ, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />bɔbɔk mǝne ne yigu sisik ne te ba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Anama lɛ bene abɛba te di, &lt;&lt;Vuŋ zhin susun! Ayi Nga. Duŋ te zhin sǝsǝk ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Fe Yesɔ akɔ yir miŋ igu ben abɛba, ngugumɔ iku zǝ kur. Bɔbɔk mǝne ne vuŋ anu, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />bane zhi kiki yi mbwab borodi ba; asusun amene ne kpa ate amimin.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ndi ne glɔ, ne yir Jenisara te kpa gumɔ aŋyak ne kɔtɔŋ nek. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Nak ru men ne gumɔ, aneshir akɔ tɔ Yesɔ azhi. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Ne klu zǝ ntuntun, te zen vu aner abɛ lɔ ne atakpa amen te gar amkpa waŋ ndi ate wɔ Yesɔ ayime. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Ankyak amkpa awaŋ ndi ate garu, ne miŋ ntun, bǝn tun vǝtsɔb aneshir avu abɛ lɔ azeshur ne amkpa ne li dub. Te zen benu abɛ duŋ ba asak aŋɔk ne ŋa anklu maa, abaŋ ndi sagu aŋɔk ne rɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Itsin kɛ yaŋ ŋgluk ben kɛ yine ŋgluk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Ferisawa ben abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa ne nyɛ rɛ Urshelima te zhɔk Yesɔ ne tsutsu <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />ayik abɛ tsene maa azǝn li kili ne &lt;&lt;aŋɔk rik,&gt;&gt; iyaŋ ŋla. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(Ferisawa bǝn Yahudawa ba li kili ba se ne ŋla aŋɔk baliŋ a gli ita iyi ŋla aŋɔk, azǝ taada atsintsim men. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ate rɛ dub ba tei li kili ba se ne su baliŋ. Ana zǝ iki na atsintsim amen, amɛ ndi aŋla kparantse, kǝkɛn bǝn agodɔ.)<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Fe Ferisawa bǝn abɛ tsar yi Musa arib Yesɔ te di, &lt;&lt;Ayi anii duŋ abɛ tsene ami ba ŋla aŋɔk ir keŋ ndi taada ane antsimtsim amɔr ne di ka te li kili ne aŋɔk rik?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesɔ asak bama tedi, &lt;&lt;Ishaya ne bla lɛ didik ne atu amin izhin abɛ kamgli ndi ne cɛr:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">&lt;&lt;&lt;Aner abaŋa a nǝm ŋgɔŋ muŋ ne bɛrenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">Ama asusun amen ayi shaan ben abɛm.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Anaga zǝm isha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">Itsar mǝne iyi bla aneshir.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Izhin ne duŋ ilɛ kǝ Arik te zǝ taada amin ane kukub.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Ankyak Yesɔ adi ba: &lt;&lt;Izhin wɔb ankɔŋ ane tyak ilɛ kǝ Arik zhɔk te izhin bǝ zǝ taada antsintsim amin! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Musa ne di, &lt;Nǝk tetɛɛ mi ben iyah mi ŋgɔŋ&gt; te, &lt;waŋ ndi ate yen tetɛɛ maa ben iyah maa tuk abɛ ŋunu.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ama izhineba di ineshir te di Tetɛɛ maa ben iyah maa: &lt;iki yiŋ ndi atei nek atetɛ atei nek Arik neyi&gt; (Iki yiŋ ndi mne ndi M tei nek zhin, mne kam baŋǝ nek Arik), <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />fe ba zhin te na duŋu ana tetɛɛ maa ben yaa maa ki nuŋ ba. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Neme wa izhin yik lɛ kɛ Arik iyi kisha ne ikiki iyi na min kukub. Izhin na kiki yiŋɛ amɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Ankyak Yesɔ azho ntsan aneshire te di, &lt;&lt;Wɔ me zhin, kɔ te ŋɔwa, abɛ zhi yiŋɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Bai ki yiŋ ndi yir ne kpa kɛ neshir yi &lt;cogu ala ba.&gt; Ayi iki yiŋ ndi ne rurɛ anu amaa yi &lt;cogu ala.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Iwaŋ ndi ayi ne atɔŋ ayi wɔ, abɛ wɔ.<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ndi ne duŋ ntsan aneshire te yir kɔb, abɛ tsene maa a rib bu lɛ kǝ lɛ kuŋkum maa. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />A rib. &lt;&lt;Ba zhin ne zhi ka?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Izhin yik iki yiŋ ndi iyir anu akɛ neshir iyi &lt;cogu ala kai&gt;? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Bane yir susun maa ba ne yir imiŋ ne maa, ite na ru ne kpa maa.&gt;&gt; (Nǝ di yiŋɛ, Yesɔ ne di kɔ di kili tayi iyi tsetser.&gt;&gt;)<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Yesɔ adi: &lt;&lt;Ki yiŋ ndi irurɛ kpa kɛ neshir iyi &lt;cogu ala.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Te ne miŋ, ne susun kɛ aneshir, kiki mimin ru remɛ, amɛ ndi ize amba bǝn alulum, zhib, ŋlɔk aneshir, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />kur bǝn alulum bǝn amba, te abubu, zumimiŋ, nyer tu, kamgli, ankiŋki, ilɛ mumur, lɛk tu, bǝn na kpukpur. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Kiki mimin yiŋɛ bɔbɔk irurɛ miŋ susun te cɔk neshir &lt;la.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itanyɛme iyi iwa ane Basurofinikiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesɔ ne duŋ amkpama te kɔmɔ ne gar kɛ Taya ne yir min kɔb bane tanyɛme te aneshir abɛ zhi ba; ne me bane zhi iyi ben iru maa ba. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Ilɛ didik, ndi iwa ma ne wɔ lɛ kɛ Yesɔ, iwa waŋ ndi va maa vǝtsɔb ayi ne anerime anyɛ zhaku ne aza maa. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Iwama ayi vǝŋɔ ne Helinawa, nga kɛ Siriya Basurofinikiya. Aben Yesɔ tedi abɛ gli anerime rumɔ ne kpa kɛ va maa.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yesɔ ablau, &lt;&lt;Duŋ amumun abɛ li baliŋ,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;ba ne rɛ te bɛ baŋ kili yi amumun didik anǝk ane viu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />&lt;&lt;Iyi amɛ, Ŋgɔŋ,&gt;&gt; Yesɔ mtanyeme, &lt;&lt;ama ane viu abaŋ ndi akur ne angus mben yi sak la ali nki kili yi amumun iyi var hrie.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Fe Yesɔ ablau, &lt;&lt;Nǝ tanyɛme yiŋɛ, kɔmɔ, anerime ne ka ru ne kpa kɛ va mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Ne kɔmɔ te kɔte yik va maa akɔ kurna ne adonke, anerime ne ka ru.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne na ner nǝ yaŋ wɔ lɛ bǝn ne ku ntam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Fe Yesɔ ne duŋ Taya te zǝ Sidon, te kɔmɔ ne nek ne Galili ne gar kɛ Dikafoli. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Aneshire anuŋ ne gli ner ne yaŋ wɔ lɛ ben ne ku ntam, te benu te bǝ sagu ŋɔk ne kpa maa.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Ndi Yesɔ ne baŋu te ru kɔnsa, te nab muno ŋɔk maa a sak ne tɔŋ maa. Ne shur ante te sak ŋɔk ne lilɛn maa. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Yesɔ ne tɔ gbarshu te zhɔk susun te diu, &lt;&lt;Ifata!&gt;&gt; (Watɔ, &lt;&lt;Bu!&gt;&gt;). <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Nǝ mee, atɔŋ yi neshire abu, iki yi kpa lilɛn maa itun te vuŋ lɛ anenen.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesɔ adiu kǝr abɛ duŋ bla nuŋ ba. Ama ndi zen bla amɛ, aneshir zen bla ki yi na maa shak amkpa. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Aneshir ne yik ki yi vuŋ anu gar kam ankɔŋɔ. &lt;&lt;Ne na kiki bɔbɔk anenen,&gt;&gt; anere adi. &lt;&lt;Yesɔ ne duŋ abɛba ben abɛ amfik atɔŋ a wɔ lɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne yɔk aneshir azhin anas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Nǝ bɛr yuŋɔ ntsan aneshir anuŋ ne biŋ, ba yine kinuŋ yi li ba, Yesɔ azho abɛ tsene maa te di, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />&lt;&lt;M lɔ susun kɛ aneshir baŋa; ne ka te bɛr tar bene bɛm iyaŋ kili. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Mte di abɛ kɔmɔ ne kasa ate ku mfɔ ne ankɔŋ, anuŋ ne miŋ mǝne are amkpa gbagbaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Abɛ tsene maa mtanyeme, &lt;&lt;Nǝ zizik kǝŋe atei yik kili yi mla yɔk aneshire abaŋa yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />&lt;&lt;Izhin yine ambwab borodi?&gt;&gt; Yesɔ arib.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">&lt;&lt;Me taŋgba,&gt;&gt; a tanyɛu ma.<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Yesɔ adi ntsan aneshire abɛ zisɔŋ ne mimi. Ndi ne baŋ ambwab borodi me taŋgba ma te nyɛr, ne mligǝ te nek abɛ tsene maa te abɛ nek aneshire, ana kɔ na mee. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Ayi ne amwe ambɛ watsɔb fe Yesɔ abaŋǝ te nyer te nek abɛ tsene maa abɛ ta gab zhine ba. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Aneshire ne li te hri. Ankyak abɛ tsǝn ama ne biŋ nki kili me isisa taŋgba ndi ne li te duŋ kime. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Aneshir abaŋ ndi ne yi amɔ ne yar azhin anas. Fe Yesɔ adi abɛ kɔmɔ, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Yesɔ akɔ yir miŋ igu bǝn abɛ tsene maa te kɔmɔ na gar kɛ Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Ferisawa ne nyɛ te rib Yesɔ kiki nuŋ te bɛ tsa ru tɔ. Tǝ abɛ nek ba ngir nuŋ kɛ rɛ gbarshu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesɔ avuŋ vli gli gɔŋ te di, &lt;&lt;Ayi nii duŋ kab kǝŋe awɔb te aba yik kiki yi vuŋ anui? Mǝ bla zhin lɛ didik, ba ngir keŋ ndi ate nek zhin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Fe Yesɔ aduŋ ba, te yir gu te glɔ kɔmɔ ne gar nuŋ.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbumbur atuntu yi Ferisawa ben Hiridus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Abɛ tsǝn amaa ne ŋuro suk ne gli kili, anaga yi mbwab kili zhin yi ben abɛba ne gumɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />&lt;&lt;Izhin bǝ te zǝ,&gt;&gt; Yesɔ agbaŋ ba atɔŋ. &lt;&lt;Izhin bǝ hria ayi te tɔ mbumbur atuntu ane Ferisawa ben ayou Hiridus.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Ne lɛ kiki yiŋɛ ne akpa mɛn te di, &lt;&lt;Ayik ba ta yine borodi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Ndi ayi ne miŋ kɛ lɛ ne akpa mɛn, Yesɔ arib ba: Ayi anii duŋ zhin di borodi ka? Ba zhin yik te na zhi kai? Asusun min ne kpa kai? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Izhin yine ayi ama ba zhin yik ba ben atɔŋ ba zhin wɔ ba? Ba zhin shuzhi kai? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Ndi mne mlik ambwab borodi tuŋ nek aneshir azhin atuŋ, neyi sisa ben ne zhin ne vu nkime?&gt;&gt; adi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">&lt;&lt;Iwur ane yaa,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />&lt;&lt;Ndi mne mlik ambwab borodi ataŋgba m gab aneshir azhin anas, neyi sisa ben zhin ne vu nkime?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Mtanyeme,&lt;&lt;Itaŋgba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Har azǝzaŋa ba zhin shuzhi kai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne na ner ne amfik ne Batseda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Ndi ne yir Batseda, aneshir anuŋ agli iner ne amfik te nyɛ te ben Yesɔ te abɛ sagu ŋɔk <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesɔ ne vuŋ ŋɔk kɛ ner ne amfik ge te ru goŋ ntun. Ndi ne ruk ante ashuru ne ayi amaa te sagu ŋɔk, Yesɔ aribu,&lt;&lt;Uyik kinuŋ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Atɔ shu tedi, &lt;&lt;Myik aneshir; ama ayi ndi atiŋe ankunkun atsǝnetsǝn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesɔ ana sak iner ne amfik ge ŋɔk neyi amaa. Fe abu ayi amaa, iyik maa ku kam nyak, ankyak akɔ yik kɔte nii glaŋglaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesɔ adiu abɛ kɔmɔ ne kɔb, &lt;&lt;kǝr bǝ yir ntun nuŋ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilɛ Biturus netu Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesɔ ben abɛ tsene maa ne gar ntuntun yi Kaseriya Filibi. Ne akɔ arib ba, &lt;&lt;Aneshir adi myi ŋɔwai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Mtanyɛmɛ tedi, &lt;&lt;Anuŋ adi Yɔɔna ne su aneshir; anuŋ adi Iliya; anuŋ adi izhin ne miŋ abɛ bla shar yi Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Arib ba. &lt;&lt;Fe izhineba fa?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Izhin di myi Ŋɔwai?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Biturus mtanyeme, &lt;&lt;Uyi kristi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yesɔ ne gbaŋ ba atɔŋ kǝr abɛ duŋ bla nuŋ kinuŋ ne tu maa ba.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne bla iku maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Fe Yesɔ avuŋ tsar ba te di Ivǝn Neshir atei yik iya ne kiki tetɛk anunkub atei na kyagu, ngɔŋ ne abɛ na ndum ne akaba bǝn abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa atei ŋunu ne goŋ kɛ bɛr yi ntar atei na lu. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yesɔ ne lɛ ki yiŋɛ aglɛ rumɔ, ankyak Biturus agliu te ru kɔnsa te atsaŋu.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ama ndi Yesɔ ne kama tɔ abɛ tsene maa, atsaŋ Biturus. &lt;&lt;Kam tibɛ, shetan!&gt;&gt; Adi. Ilɛ kǝ susun mi ba rɛ bǝn Arik ba, anaga yi kiki yi aneshir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Fe azho ntsan aneshire ben abɛ tsene maa te di: &lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ate di wa atei zǝm abɛ kyak tu maa te baŋ mkpɔk nkunkun kǝ gen maa te zǝm <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Iwaŋ ndi ate di wa atei na ivli maa aŋyak ba tei yik kɛ ba, ama waŋ ndi ate kyak vli maa ne tu muŋ bǝn ilɛ didik kǝ men ne ta kǝ azhɔk. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ayi ki didik tayi ndi neshir atei yik adudunki iyi gɔnmimi te suk ivli maa? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Aye anii neshir atei nǝge tǝ ta ivli maa zhɔk? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Iwaŋ ndi ate shisha yi bla lɛ muŋ ne kab keŋ ndi ne kam goŋ anem te na zumimin, Ivǝn Neshir atei te shisha maa ndi ate nyɛ ne ngɔŋ kɛ Tetɛɛ maa bǝn abɛ shar ayou Arik abɛ yi tsetser.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Fe Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Mbla zhin lɛ didik, anuŋ ndi a klikli ayaŋa batei yik iku te ashe yir kɔb Arik ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpa kɛ Yesɔ ne sen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ndi bɛr tani ne gayir Yesɔ ne baŋ Biturus, Yakubu ben Yɔɔna ben bɔu te gli ba te yuŋ igbu lɛlɛ, abǝba ankyak ne nak yi ne amɔ. Ne mwɔ Yesɔ ne sǝn ikpa maa ne ti men. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Iki yi su maa ne kam te klikla, ndi ba nuŋ ne gɔnmimi ndi ate ya ŋla iki duŋǝ klak amɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Fe Iliya ben Musa amunoru ne atsutsu men, te lɛ ben Yesɔ.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Biturus adi Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Ne Tsar, ne rɛ tǝ ta yi ayaŋa. Duŋ ta na abur amɛ tar, izhiin bǝ yi mi, izhiin ikɛ Musa inuŋ bǝ yi kɛ Iliya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />(Biturus bane yi ne kiyi bla ba, sǝsǝk ne te ba.)<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Fe akpa anyɛ ku ba, awɔ kɔr ire miŋ amkpama te di: &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi izu muŋ, waŋa ndi me nyeru. Wɔ zhin ne wu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Ankyak, ndi ne kam tɔ, ba ne na yik nuŋ ba anak ayi Yesɔ wa ankyak.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ndi azǝn zi ne gbumɔ, Yesɔ ne gbaŋ ba atɔŋ kǝr abɛ bla nuŋ iki yiŋ ndi ne yik ba se Izu neshir ne lu ne bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Nǝ Gli ilɛmɛ ne asusun amen, te lɛ ne akpa tedi anii, &lt;&lt;ilu ne bɛ me&gt;&gt; Idi.<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Fe arib Yesɔ tedi, &lt;&lt;Ai yi ne duŋ abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa ne di Iliya wa atei kuti anyɛi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Iyi amɛ, Iliya wa atei kuti nyɛ, tena kiki aŋyak bɔbɔk. Tǝ aye nii ne cɛr tedi Izu Neshir atei yik iyah tetɛk te na kyak gui? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ama mbla zhin, Iliya ne ka nyɛ, ne ka nau iki yiŋ ndi nɛrɛ ba, ndi ne cɛr ne atu amaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ne duŋ vǝvǝn neyi ne anerim arɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ndi ne nyɛ ben nki abɛ tsene maa, ne yik ntsan aneshir ne goŋ ba ri abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa azǝn te antam ben abɛba. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ankyak ndi aneshir bɔbɔk ne yik Yesɔ, ne sak aŋɔk ne anu te klu gar tegu.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesɔ arib ba tedi, izhin te antam ayi anii ben abɛba yi?<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Ineshir nuŋ ne miŋ kɛ aneshir asagu ma te di, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar, Mne gliu izu muŋ, waŋ ndi anerim aduŋu aku amkpen. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Mkpaŋ keŋ ndi ilɔmɔ te lu, ibaŋu tyak zhɔk ne mimi. Aru amfu nɛ ne, te ŋu aŋin tɛ aku asi. Mne mben abɛ tsene ami bɛ gli anerime agli arumɔ, ama bane nau ayir ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Ankyak Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Aneshir abɛ mkpaŋ kǝŋe abɛ yaŋ tanyɛmɛ ne asusun, &lt;&lt;M tei sɔŋ ben abɛ zhin igar mkpaŋ takɛ? Gli zhin vǝvǝne gli nyɛmɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Fe agliu vǝvǝne. Ndi anerime ne yik Yesɔ, ne amkpama ilɔmɔ iduŋ vǝvǝne aku asi. Azhaku ne mimi, te ru amfu nenu.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesɔ arib tetɛɛ maa vǝvǝne, &lt;&lt;Ana amɛ are atentai?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">&lt;&lt;Tetɛɛ maa vǝvǝne adi, &lt;&lt;Ire mkpaŋ keŋ ndi ne ŋliu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />&lt;&lt;Iben tyagu zhɔk ne lu ben amashir te ibǝ ŋunu. Ama ate yi ndi utǝ ya na kinuŋ, lɔ susun mɔr te lɔk tama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesɔ adiu &lt;&lt;&lt;Te anii udi tem tei ya mai&gt;? &lt;&lt;kɔte nii itei te ben abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ ne susun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Andanda tetɛɛ ma vǝvǝne alǝk kɔr te di, &lt;&lt;Mne tanyɛmɛ; duŋ tanyɛmɛ muŋ bɛ yi tetɛk!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yik ntsan aneshir aklu aru, atsaŋ anerime tedi, &lt;&lt;Uwa irim ne yaŋ lɛ, &lt;&lt;Mdiu, bǝ ru ne kpa kɛ vǝvǝn waŋa kǝr bǝ na yiru ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Irime ate ahwa, te ŋur vǝvǝne ngɔŋ atyak zhɔk ne mimi te ru. Ankyak vǝvǝne akur ndi kum ndi aneshir tetɛk ne di, &lt;&lt;Vǝvǝne aku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ama Yesɔ avuŋ vǝvǝne ne ŋɔk te lɛgu aŋyak adidik, ankyak vǝvǝne alu akli.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yir kɔb, abɛ tsene maa ne rib bu raraŋ, &lt;&lt;Anii ne duŋ ta bane ya yar rim waŋa gli rumɔ kai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Iyiŋɛ itei ru ne ben Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Nǝ duŋ amɔ te zǝ ntun Galili. Yesɔ ba ne wɔb te kǝr nuŋ abɛ zhi amkpa waŋ ndi aba yime ba, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />te ne zǝ tsar abɛ tsene maa. Adi ba, &lt;&lt;atei baŋ izu neshir alɛb aneshir. atei ŋunu, iber yi tar ate lu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ama ba ne zhi iki yiŋ ndi abla ma ba te te sisik rib bu ma.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋɔwa ayi ŋgɔŋ anaŋ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Ndi ne nyɛ kafanahum. Yesɔ ne yi miŋ kɔb, ne rib abɛ na ndum amaa te di, &lt;&lt;Izhin ne zen te antam ne atu ye ni ne ankɔŋ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ama ba ne bu anu ba te ne zen te atam ne atu ayi ŋɔwa ayi ngɔŋ anaŋ.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Ndi Yesɔ ne zǝ sɔŋ, ne zhɔ awur aneyaa abe tsene maa te di ba, &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ate wɔb te wa bǝ yi ne kuti, bǝ nak yi ne klɛtu, te bǝ yi igen ayi kɔte ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Yesɔ avuŋ vǝvǝn vǝtsɔb alǝk aŋyak adidik ne atsutsu men. Te baŋu agli ne ampa, te di ba, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />&lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ate ta izhin ne miŋ kɛ amumun abaŋa ne sak muŋ ne ta nga; iwaŋ ndi ate tam ba ne tam ba ama ne ta waŋ ndi ne shar me.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwaŋ ndi ba te te zor ben abɛta ba ayi amɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yɔɔna adi, &lt;&lt;Nǝ tsar,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;ta ne yik ner nuŋ agli anerim arumɔ ne kpa kɛ aneshir, te ba yi bene abɛta ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;kǝr zhin bǝ yaru ma ba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;ba waŋ ndi ana kiki yi vuŋ anu ne sak muŋ te lǝlɛ mimin ne atu amuŋ, <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />iwaŋ ndi ba te zor ben abɛta ba ayi ben abɛta. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Mbla zhin lǝ lɛ didik, iwaŋ ndi ate nek zhin amashir ne kparantse ne sak muŋ te zhin yi ben Kristi ba tei yaŋ ta idǝk ma ba.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iki duŋ aneshir ana zumimin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />&lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ate duŋ nuŋ ne miŋ kɛ amuotsɔtsɔb abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛm alalɛ, itei naŋ te abɛ baŋ mkpaŋ nena ŋgon akpau ne tɔ te baŋu atyak azhɔk ne nek. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Ate yi ndi ŋɔk mi duŋu la lɛ, ubǝ sɛr kɛ kyaŋ. Itei rɛ te ubǝ yir ikɔb Arik ne ivli mi ne ŋɔk zhin te ubǝ yi ne aŋɔk ayaa te yir lu, <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Amɔ nkis yiŋ ndi tei li bama ba tei ku ba, neme ilu kǝ goŋ bama ba tei rim ba. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Itei nayi ndi iza mi duŋu la lɛ, sɛr kɛ kyaŋ. Itei rɛ te ubǝ yir ikɔb Arik ne ivli mi ne mkpɔk za inaŋ te ubǝ yir ne aza yaa te yir lu. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Amɔ nkis yiŋ ndi tei li bama ba tei ku ba, neme ilu kǝ goŋ bama ba tei rim ba. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Ate yi ndi iyi mi itei duŋu la lɛ, tuŋ kɛ tibɛ. Itei rɛ te ubǝ yir kɔb Arik ne yi zhin te ubǝ yir ne ayi ayaa te yir lu, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Amɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:48">&lt;&lt;&lt;Nkis mǝne ba ku ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:48">Ilumɔ ba rim ba.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Atei kla kɔte ŋɔwa ndi aren imaŋ ne lu.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />&lt;&lt;Imaŋ irɛ, imen maa te klɛ, itei na kikin te duŋ men maa bǝ kam nyak? Izhin bǝ yi ndi maŋ, te sɔŋ zhin keke ne akpa amin.<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Kǝr abɛ kluk nŋa ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Fe Yesɔ ne duŋ amɔ te gar ntun yi Yahudiya ne goŋ nek ne Urdu. Ntsan aneshir nena nyɛ ben abɔu, nena tsar ba, ir keŋ ndi abɛ nama.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Ane Ferisawa nuŋ ne nyɛ bǝn abɔu te tsa ru tɔ te di, &lt;&lt;ire te lulum abɛ kyak iwa mai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Musa ne cɛr zhin te di kikinǝ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Adi, &lt;&lt;Musa ne tanyɛmɛ te lulum abɛ cɛr mplɛ kɛ kluk nŋa anǝk iwa maa te yaru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesɔ adi ba ayi klik atu min waŋai ki ndi Musa ne bla zhin ilɛ kǝ kpa nyak amɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />&lt;&lt;Ama ne kuti Arik ne &lt;na lulum ben iwa.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />&lt;Neme lulum atei duŋ tetɛɛ amaa ben iyah amaa te ama yaŋ ben iwa maa, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />iyah mǝne atei yi kpa zhiin.&gt; Neme ba yi akpa ayaa ba ama ikpa zhiin. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Neme iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne biŋǝ, kǝr inuŋ abɛ klugǝ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ndi neyi ne kɔbɔ, abɛ tsene maa aribu ilɛ kǝŋe. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Adi ba, &lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ate kyak iwa maa tǝ ta nuŋ ne la lɛ kǝ ze amba ben iwa amaa. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Ate yi ndi iwa ate kyak lu maa te ŋa nuŋ, ne la lɛ kǝ ze alulum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ben amumun amuotsɔtsɔb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Aneshir azǝn gli Yesɔ amumun amuotsɔtsɔb te abɛ sak ba aŋɔk, ama abɛ tsene amaa ne tsaŋ ba. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yik amɛ, ne te mfu. Adi ba, &lt;&lt;Duŋ zhin amumun amuotsɔtsɔb anyɛ bǝn abɛm, kǝr zhin bǝ yar ba, te ikɔb kǝ Arik yi ir mǝne. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Mbla zhin lɛ didik, waŋ ndi ba te ta Arik ndi amumun amuotsɔtsɔb abaŋa ba batei yir kɔb Arik ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Ankyak Yesɔ avu amumun ne agli ne asa amaa te nek ba anu didik.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iner ne yi ne adudun ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Ndi Yesɔ ne atsǝnetsǝn ne ankɔŋ, iner ne yi ne adudunki nuŋ aklu nyɛ zhaku ne aza amaa. Aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar didik,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;M tei na anii tem yik ivli kǝ yaŋ klɛtu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Uzhɔm te ne tsar didik te nii?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Nǝ tsar didik ba yime ba, Arik wa ankyak ai nǝ Tsar didik. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Une zhi icɛr yi Musa ne di: &lt;Kǝr ubǝ ŋun neshir ba, kǝr ubǝ ze amba ba, kǝr ubǝ zhib ba, kǝr ubǝ timu ba, kǝr ubǝ kyer iki yi nuŋ ta ba, ubǝ nek tetɛɛ mi ben iyah mi ngoŋ men.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Neshire adi, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mne na kiki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk mdi ne nak ri yi vǝvǝn vǝtsɔb.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesɔ ne tɔu te nyeru, te diu, &lt;&lt;Iki zhin ba une zen nai ba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;kɔte vu adudunki yiŋ ndi uyime neyi lɛb bɔbɔk te nek abɛ yaŋ iki, te utei yi ne adudun ki ne gbarshu. Fe te kam nyɛ zǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Ndi neshire ne wɔ amɛ azhizhi ne ku. Nǝ kama tibɛ te kpa ti te tǝ mfu, tǝ wa ayi ne adudunki.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesɔ ne kama tɔ abɛ tsene maa te di, &lt;&lt;Itei lɔ te neyi ne adudunki abɛ yir kɔb Arik!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Abɛ tsene maa asak aŋɔk ne anu ne iki yiŋ ndi Yesɔ ne blai. Ama Yesɔ ne na di ba, &lt;&lt;Amumun amuŋ, kɔb Arik ilɔ yir! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Itei yi tatak te lakurmi abɛ yir mblu alura inaŋ ne adudunki abɛ yir kɔb Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Abɛ tsene maa ne vuŋ anu ngɔŋ, te di akpa men, &lt;&lt;Te iŋɔwa atei yik ita zhɔk!?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesɔ atɔ ba te di, &lt;&lt;Bǝn ineshir itei lɔmɔ, ama ba ben Arik ba; kɔte anii itei te ben Arik.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Biturus adi Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Ta ne duŋ ikiki bɔbɔk te zeu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Mbla zhin ilɛ didik,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ne duŋ kɔb maa ka zumen ka ai va men ka ai iya maa ka ai tetɛɛ maa ka ai amumun amaa ka ai ahwaŋ amaa ne sak kɛ lɛ didik kɛ Arik <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />te ba atei ta idǝk kɛ naŋ amkpaŋ amkplik azhin ne kab kǝŋe (ka ai akɔb, amunzu, amunva, aneyaa, amumun ben ahwaŋ, neme bɔbɔk, ina yik iya) bǝn mkpaŋ kɛ nyɛ, atei yik ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Ama aneshir tetɛk anuŋ abɛ kuti atei yi abɛ klɛtu, abɛ klɛtu atei yi abɛ kuti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ne na bla iku maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Nǝ yi ne ankɔŋ ne gar Urshelima, Yesɔ ne kuti mǝne, abɛ zeu tsin amaa ne sak aŋɔk ne anu, aneshir abaŋ ndi ne zǝ ba ne te sisik. Ankyak Yesɔ ne na Gli abɛ zeu tsin amaa te gar kɔnsa te bla ba iki yiŋ ndi itei vuŋ wa. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ta gar Urshelima, atei vuŋ Izu Neshir alɛb ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik ben abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa. atei teu ambuk ayi ku te baŋu anǝk abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />atei zhabu, te ruk ante shuru, te tsǝgu, te ŋunu. Iber tar te gayir atei lu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iben yi Yakubu ben Yɔɔna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Ankyak Yakubu ben Yɔɔna, amun Zebɛdi, anyɛ ben Yesɔ te di, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;ta wɔb te ubǝ naa ta bɔbɔk iki yiŋ ndi ta benu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesɔ arib ba te di, &lt;&lt;izhin wɔb tem naa zhin anii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Adi Yesɔ te di, &lt;&lt;Duŋ izhin ne miŋ mɔr abɛ sɔŋ ne ŋɔk li mi te izhin abɛ sɔŋ ne ŋɔk mla mi ne bɛr nek ngɔŋ mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ba zhin ne zhi iki yiŋ ndi izhin wɔ bǝ ba, izhin tei ya so ne kparantse keŋ ndi msomɔi, ka izhin tei ya su amashir awaŋ ndi me su newumɔi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Adiu, &lt;&lt;Aba atei yaa maa.&gt;&gt; Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin te so ne kparantse keŋ ndi me so te su ne amashir awaŋ ndi me sumɔ ne wu, <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />ama isɔŋ ne ŋɔk li muŋ kɔ ŋɔk mla muŋ ba ayi nga wa M tei nek zhin ne kǝ ba. Mkpǝmkpa yiŋɛ iyi iye abaŋ ndi ne ka nai aŋyak ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ndi nki awur abɛ zeu tsin amaa ne wɔ lɛ kǝŋe, ne te mfu ben Yakubu ben Yɔɔna. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yesɔ ne zhɔ ba abiŋ tedi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin ne zhi abaŋ ndi ayik ba ashak ayi ndi abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba, angɔŋgɔŋ amene atsar ba mgbyamgbyaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ba yi amɛ bǝn abɛ zhin ba. Neme, iwaŋ ndi awɔb te wa abɛ yi ŋgɔŋ ne miŋ min abɛ na tu maa ate igɛn, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />iwaŋ ndi awɔb te wa abɛ yi ne kuti abɛ yi igen amin bɔbɔk. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Tǝ ba Izu Neshir bane anyɛ te bɛ zekuru ba, ama ne nyɛ te bɛ yi igen, te bɛ na nek susun maa te bɛ nek ba ivli te ta aneshir azhɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ne bu ayi Bartimawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Ankyak ndi ne nyɛ Jerikɔ. Ndi Yesɔ ben abɛ tsene maa, ben ntsan aneshir, a duŋ ntuno, Bartimawus ine amfik, (ndi, ayi zu Timawus), ne kɔsɔŋ aben ki ne kɔtɔŋ ankɔŋ. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ndi ne wɔ adi ai Yesɔ awɔnǝ Nazara, akɔ te ahwa te di, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ, Izu Doda, lɔ susun muŋ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Aneshir tetɛk atsaŋu te diu abɛ ku anu, ama akyak te te ahwa ngɔŋ te di, &lt;&lt;Izu Doda, lɔ susun muŋ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesɔ agbur aklɛ te di, &lt;&lt;Zhɔzhin ne wu.&gt;&gt; Ankyak abɛ tsene maa azho ner ne amfik ge te diu, &lt;&lt;Sɛr nyak! Nǝ aza mi! Yesɔ azhɔu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Ankyak iner ne amfik ge atyak anklu kɛ ku mvlu maa azhɔk, te tuk ne aza amaa te nyɛ ben Yesɔ.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Uwɔb te bɛ nau anii?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Iner ne amfik ge adi, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar, mwɔb tem yik amkpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Tsin kɔmɔ, itanyɛmɛ mi ne duŋu rɛ.&gt;&gt; Nǝ amkpamkpama ayi ner ne amfik ge abu te zǝ Yesɔ akɔmɔ.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ne yir Urushelima ndi tum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Ndi Yesɔ ben abɛ tsene maa ne te gbahir ne Urshelima te nyɛ Betafaji ben Batanya ne Igbu yi Zetun, Yesɔ ne shar amɛ ayaa ne min kɛ abɛ tsǝn amaa, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />te di ba, &lt;&lt;Gar zhin ntun yiŋ ndi iyi ne ti min, izhin te nak yir, izhin tei yik ne akpa tatur aŋyak amɔ, iwaŋ ndi ba ner nuŋ ndi ne yuŋɔ atɔ. Izhin bǝ zu gu Gli nyɛmɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Inuŋ ate rib zhin te di, &lt;Izhin zuk nŋa ma tǝ ni?&gt; Izhin bǝ diu, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ awɔbu atei gliu aŋur akama aŋyaga ne mkpaŋ watsɔb.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Ne gar ate yik ne kpa nŋa ma aŋyak ne abɛm, ne anɔkɔŋ. Ndi ne zu gu, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />aneshir anuŋ ne aklɛkli ne amkpama te rib ba te di, &lt;&lt;Izhin zuk nŋa ma te gar amɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Nǝ bla ba ir keŋ ndi Yesɔ ne bla ba bǝ blama, ankyak aneshir aduŋ ba kɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Ndi ne gli nŋa ma agli Yesɔ mɔ ankyak aneshir ne vu nklunklu yi ku mvlu men asak ne tu nŋa ma, fe Yesɔ ayuŋɔ asɔŋ ne tu nŋa ma. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Aneshir tetɛk ne lab nklunklu men ne ankɔŋ, anuŋ ne lab amgbaamvu ndi ne ŋai ne zizik. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Abaŋ ndi ne kuti ben abaŋ ndi azǝ ngɔŋ maa ate ahwa te di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">&lt;&lt;Gbar asak ye Arik!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">&lt;&lt;Anu adidik ayi ben waŋ ndi anyɛ ne sak kɛ Arik!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />&lt;&lt;Anu adidik abɛ yi ben ikɔb Ngɔŋ kɛ nyɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Doda!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">&lt;&lt;Gbar asak ye Arik ne gbarshu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesɔ ne yir Urshelima te yir Akabakɔŋ. Te tɔ kiki bɔbɔk, ama amgbalu ne ka te, te ru iwa ben abɛ tsene maa amɛ wur ane yaa te gar Batanya.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ne nek itiŋ nglǝŋglǝ anu amimin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Nǝ bɛr yi yaa ndi aduŋ Batanya, ikasa ne vuŋ Yesɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Ndi ari yi gbagbaŋ ne yik tiŋ nglǝnglǝ iyi amgba ashushu, te gar ka iwa atei yik kɛ ne dɔ. Ndi ne yir itiŋ nglǝŋglǝ me, bane yik kɛ ne dɔ ba nak yi ne amgbamvu ankyak, te bai mkpaŋ kɛ dɔ maa ba. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Ankyak Yesɔ akɔdi itiŋ nglǝnglǝ me, &lt;&lt;kǝr iner nuŋ abena li idɔ mi ba yaŋ klɛtu.&gt;&gt; Abɛ tsene maa ne wɔu ne bla lɛ kǝŋe.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Ndi ne yir Urshelima, Yesɔ ne yir Akabakɔŋ te yar abɛ zen li dub ndi alɛb tena vu alɛb amɔ. Te akam kiki yi lɛb mǝne atyak ahrie te tur mben yi sɔŋ abɛ lɛb ki te zuk ane angu abɛ kɔb ashur, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />te na yar aneshir igli ki te yir miŋ Akabakɔŋ. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Fe ne tsar ba, te di, &lt;&lt;Bane cɛr te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">&lt;&lt;&lt;Atei zhɔ akabankɔŋ muŋ te</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:17">Ikɔb kɛ ben Arik kɛ aneshir bɔbɔk&gt;?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 11:17">Ama izhin ne duŋ kɛ iyi zhin &lt;amkpa ane suyir te zhib.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Ngɔŋ ne abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik ben abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa ne wɔ amɛ te wɔb ankɔŋ awaŋ ndi aba atei ŋunu, te aklu sisik maa, te ntsan aneshir bɔbɔk ne sak aŋɔk ne anu ne tsar maa.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ndi amgbalu te, Yesɔ ben abɛ zeu tsǝn amaa aru ne ntuno.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itiŋ nglǝŋglǝ me ne ku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Nǝ bɛr yi yaa maa, ne gayir, te yik itiŋ nglǝŋglǝ me ne ku rɛ ririŋ maa. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Biturus ne shu azhi te di Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar, tɔ! Itiŋ nglǝŋglǝ kǝme ndi une te kɛ anu amimin ne ne ku!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesɔ adiu. &lt;&lt;Bǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn Arik.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />&lt;&lt;Mbla zhin lɛ didik, inuŋ ate di Igbu yiŋɛ, sɛr, kɔte kyaŋ ku ne nek,&gt; te ba te yaŋ tanyɛmɛ ne susun ba ama ne tanyɛme te di iki yiŋ ndi wa ne blai itei na, itei nayi ndi awɔb. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Neme mbla zhin, iki yiŋ ndi izhin te bene, tanyɛmɛ te di izhin neka yige, itei na yi imin. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Izhin te tei lu kli te ben Arik, ate yi ndi ugli nuŋ ne susun, zugu zhɔk, te Tetɛɛ mi ne gbarshu atei na zu gu azhɔk.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Ama izhin te kyak zuk nuŋ zhɔk, te Tetɛɛ ne shu batei zuk zhin azhɔk ne lalɛ min ba.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne rib kɛ mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesɔ bǝn abɛ tsene ne yir Urshelima, ndi ne zen tsen ne miŋ Akabankɔŋ, ngɔŋ ne abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik, abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa ben anunkub ne nyɛ ben abɔu. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Aribu te di, &lt;&lt;U na kiki yiŋɛ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ takɛ? Ŋɔ ne nǝgu mgbemgbeb kɛ bla lɛ kǝŋe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;M tei rib zhin lɛ zhin. Izhin te blam, M tei na bla zhin ka Mna ikiki yiŋɛ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ta kɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Isu aneshir yi Yɔɔna, ire gbarshu, ka ire ben aneshir ini? Blam me zhin!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Akɔ lɛ ne akpa mɛn te di, &lt;&lt;ta te di, &lt;Ire gbarshu,&gt; &lt;atei rib ta te di, &lt;Tǝ anii duŋ zhin kyak tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu?&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ama tate di, &lt;Ire bǝn aneshir&gt; (Ate sisik aneshir, te bɔbɔk aneshir ne tanyɛmɛ te di Yɔɔna ayi ine bla shar yi Arik.)<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Ankyak adi Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Bata ne zhi ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Nga muŋ yi bam tei bla zhin ka mna kiki yiŋɛ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ takɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Nkan lɛ aner abɛ na ndum azɔb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesɔ ne lɛ bǝn abɛ na ndum amaa ne nkan lelɛ: &lt;&lt;Iner nuŋ ne shi nkunkun inebi ne ahwaŋ amaa. Te kam ahwaŋa azik ne adampem, ane ka dudu kɛ yi ama nkunkun inebi me. Ankyak ne baŋ ahwaŋa asak aner anuŋ abe blɛ ne aŋɔk te gar tsǝn. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Ndi mkpaŋ kɛ kye idɔ inebi ne te ne shar izhin ne miŋ kɛ agen amaa bǝn abɛ na ndum ne ahwaŋa te abɛ te ta wa idɔ inebi nuŋ ben abɛba. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ama abɛ na ndum ne ahwaŋa ne vuŋu, te tsǝgu te yaru te duŋu akama kɔmɔ aŋɔk akluklu. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Fe ne na shar igen nuŋ ben abɛba; abɛ na ndum ne ahwaŋa ne vuŋu te tsǝgu ne tu te sagu iyah te duŋu akama kɔmɔ ne shisha. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Nǝ na shar igen nuŋ, abɛ na ndumo atsǝgu aŋun. Nǝ shar agɛn tetɛk; ne tsik anuŋ te aŋlɔk anuŋ.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />&lt;&lt;Ayi ne zhin ndi ne dǝk, iwaŋ ndi ayi zu maa ankyak, ndi a nyeru. Nǝ shar ine klɛ ŋɔk, te di, &lt;atei nugu ŋgɔŋ tei ayi izu muŋ.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />&lt;&lt;Ama abɛ na ndum ne ahwaŋa adi akpa amen, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi ne li gadu maa. Nyɛ zhin, te tabǝ ŋunu, te gadu mɔ bǝ yi mɔr.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ankyak avuŋu te tsegu aŋun, te baŋu tyak azhɔk ne goŋ ahwaŋa.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />&lt;&lt;Akiki ne ahwaŋa atei na anii? Iner ne ahwaŋa atei nyɛ te tsik abɛ na ndum ne ahwaŋa a ŋlɔk te baŋ ahwaŋa anǝk anuŋ. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Ba zhin tɔ cɛr yiŋɛ ka:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">&lt;&lt;&lt;Mkpaŋ yiŋ ndi abɛ me ne kyagǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">Iyi ne nyage ne nju ki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">Arik wa nena iki yiŋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">Waŋa ai ki sak ŋɔk ne anu ne ayi mɔr&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Arik wa nena iki yiŋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">Waŋa ai ki sak ŋɔk ne anu ne ayi mɔr&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Fe awɔb ankɔŋ ne vuŋu Yesɔ te zhi ne lɛ nkan lelɛ yiŋɛ ne atu men. Ama ne te sisik ntsan aneshir; ankyak akama tibɛ te duŋu te kɔmɔ.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyah Kaisar gandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Ndi ne kɔmɔ ne te shar anuŋ abɛ Ferisawa ben aneshir abɛ Hiridus te bɛ kɔte ten Yesɔ ne lɛ maa. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Nǝ nyɛ bǝn abɔu te di, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar, ta ne zhi te uyi ner waŋ ndi anugu ngɔŋ. Bau tanyɛmɛ bǝn nuŋ te kyak nuŋ ba, bau nek tu mi bǝn anuŋ ba; ama utsar ne ankɔŋ ayou Arik ne ankɔŋ adidik. Ire te abɛ nek Kaisar gendu ka ta bǝ yaa kaisar ka tabǝ duŋ ini? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Tabǝ yaa ka tabǝ duŋ ini?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:15">Ama Yesɔ ne zhi kamgli mǝne. Arib ba te di, &lt;&lt;Aye nii te izhin wɔb ten me?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Glime zhin azɔbɔ tem tɔ kɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Nǝ gliu izɔb zinariya, ankyak arib ba te di, &lt;&lt;Igɔŋ izɔb zinariya kǝŋe ne cɛr sak kɛ ŋɔwai? Ai izhu iŋɔwa ne sage ne miŋe?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Adi, &lt;&lt;iyi kɛ Kaisar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Ankyak Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Nǝk zhin kaisar iki yiŋ ndi iyi maa tena nek zhin Arik iki yiŋ ndi iyi Arik.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Ankyak asak aŋɔk ne anu ne atu yi Yesɔ.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nŋa ndi ate lu ne bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Fe Sadukiyawa, abaŋ ndi adi ilu ne bɛ ba yime ba, anyɛ ben Yesɔ ne rib bu. <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />Te di, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar&gt;&gt;, Musa ne cɛr ta te di waŋ ndi izumen te ku te duŋ iwa maa ama ba ne yi ne amumun ba, izumen abɛ ta iwama kɔ atei duŋu aŋli zumen amumun. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Neme amunwa nuŋ amɛ ataŋgba. Nǝ kuti ne tawa ma te ku ba ne yi ne amumun ba. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Fe ne zeu ma ne ta iwa maa, te na ku, yaŋ ŋli amumun. Ina yi amɛ ben ne ntar ma. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Le didik, Itaŋgba mǝne ba nuŋ ne yi ne amumun ba. Nǝ klɛtu, iwama ne ku mayi. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Ndi te lu ne bɛ iwama atei yi ayou ŋɔwai, te Itaŋgba mǝne ne tau?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Ba zhin ne dur ka izhin ne zhi ilɛ kǝ Arik bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ mai? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Abɛ kuti te lu ne bɛ, ba atei ta amba ba, ba tei na duŋ amba aŋa ba; atei yi ndi abɛ shar ayou Arik ne Gbarshu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Fe ne atu ayi abɛ lu ne bɛ, ba zhin ne tɔ cɛr yi Musa ka, ne miŋ zizik, ndi Arik ne diu, &lt;Myi Arik ayou Ibrai, Arik ayou Ishaku, ben Arik ayou Yakubu&gt;? <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Ba yi Arik abɛ ku ba, ama ayi Arik abɛ vli. Izhin ne dur ngɔŋ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Le ngɔŋ kɛ nek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Inuŋ ne tsar icɛr yi Musa ne nyɛ te wɔ ba zen nga aŋa. Te wɔ Yesɔ ne nek ba lɛ anenen, te rib Yesɔ te di, &lt;&lt;Nǝ lǝlɛ yiŋɛ bɔbɔk, itakɛ iyi ngɔŋɔi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Ilɛ didik ngɔŋɔ,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;kǝkɛŋ,&gt;&gt; &lt;Wɔ zhin, aner abɛ Isrela, Arik amɔr Ngɔŋ, Arik ayi zhin. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Nyer Arik ami ne susun mi bɔbɔk bǝn ikpa mi bǝn izhi mi bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ mi bɔbɔk.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Iyi yaa iyi yiŋɛ, &lt;Nyer ikpami ndi tu mi.&gt; Ilɛ ngɔŋ kǝ kpa nyak nuŋ ba naŋ kǝŋe ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />&lt;&lt;Une bla anenen, ne tsar,&gt;&gt; ine tsar cɛr yi Musa adi Yesɔ. &lt;&lt;Ubla izub ndi udi Arik ayi zhiin inuŋ ba ayime ba anaga yi wa kiki maa. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Ubɛ nyer Arik ne susun mi bɔbɔk, bǝn izhi mi bǝn iklik mi, te na nyer ikpa mi ndi itu mi ire naŋ ubɛ na ikiki yiŋɛ inaŋ ndi ubɛ tsik Arik ibaŋ yi narum goŋ ben yi yak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Ndi Yesɔ ayigu ne lɛ ne Mgbemgbeb, adiu, &lt;&lt;Bau yi shaan ne kɔb Arik ba.&gt;&gt; Vuŋ rɛ mkpaŋ yuŋɔ ba nuŋ ne na rib Yesɔ ilɛ nuŋ ba.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ne rib ayi ŋɔwa ayi Kristi me</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Ndi Yesɔ ne zen tsar ne miŋ Akabakɔŋ, ne rib bu te di, &lt;&lt;Tǝ ayi anii duŋ ne tsar cɛr yi Musa adi Kristi ayi izu Doda? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Doda wa tu maa, Izhu tsetser ne duŋ lɛ, te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">&lt;&lt;&lt;Arik ne di Arik amuŋ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">&lt;&lt;Zisɔŋ ne ŋɔk li muŋ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">M tei duŋ abɛ te zɔr ben abɔu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Asɔŋ ne aza mi.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Doda wa ne tu maa ne zhɔu te &lt;Ŋgɔŋ.&gt; Tǝ wa atei na kikin teyi zu maa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Ntsan aneshir ne wɔu te nyɛr.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Nǝ tsar maa, Yesɔ ne di, &lt;&lt;Izhin bǝ te ze bǝn abɛ tsar icɛr yi Musa. Atsǝn ne nklunklu gɔngɔŋ te wɔb te aneshir abɛ tek ba ne dub, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />te na wɔb sɔŋ ne mben didik ne akabakɔŋ bǝn amkpa ane na igyaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />A vu iki ambakɔ ne akɔb amen te na baŋ mkpaŋ tetɛk te ben Arik. atei sak aner abaŋa iya ngɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwakɔ ne nek Arik anini ayaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesɔ ne zǝ sɔŋ ne kɔnsa gbahir ne mgbɔ iyi shur azɔb te zen tɔ aneshir azen shur azɔb ne mgbo ne akabakɔŋ. Aneshir abɛ yi ne adudunki anǝk azɔb tetɛk. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ankyak iwakɔ ne te iyah ne anyɛ nek anini ayaa, mgbalak azɔb zhiin.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yesɔ ne zhɔ abɛ tsene maa, te di ba, &lt;&lt;mbla zhin lɛ didik, iwakɔ waŋa ne shur azɔb ne mgbo ne nek tetɛk anaŋ nki aneshire. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Aba ne nek ne miŋ kɛ adudunki amen; ama iwakɔ waŋa, ne iyah maa ne nek iki yiŋ ndi ayime neyi bɔbɔk ne sɔŋ maa kɛ gɔŋmimi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ngir mkpaŋ kɛ klɛ tu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Ndi Yesɔ ne ru ne akabakɔŋ, izhiin ne miŋ kɛ abɛ tsene maa adiu, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar! Tɔ, mkpaŋ goŋgɔŋ didik yiŋɛ dei! Tena tɔ sak aner abaŋa iya ngɔŋ ne imɛ didik yiŋɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Izhin yik imɛ ngɔngɔŋ yiŋɛ?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mkpaŋ nuŋ ba tei sɔŋ netu kɛ nuŋ ba; kɔte tayi atei sei avar atyak azhɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Ndi Yesɔ ne kɔ sɔŋ ne Igbu yi Zetun ndi atɔ kpa ben Akabakɔŋ, ane Biturus ben Yakubu, Yɔɔna ben Anduru aribu ne kɔnsa te di, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />&lt;&lt;Bla ta, iki yiŋɛ ite na atentai? Anii itei yi ngir kɛ shak ikiki yiŋɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesɔ adi ba: &lt;&lt;Izhin bǝ sɔŋ shur ayi te kǝr nuŋ bǝ lɔm zhin ba. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Aner tetɛk atei nyɛ ne sak muŋ, te di, &lt;Aba ayi nga,&gt; Te lɔm aneshir tetɛk. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Izhin tei wɔ lɛ kɛ ikum ben lǝlɛ yi kum, kǝr asusun amin abɛ lu aklɛ ba. Ikiki yiŋɛ itei na, ama iklɛtu ba ne zen nyɛ ba. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Ntun tei wɔb ntun ne akla, atum atei wɔb atum ne akla. Mimi tei jaŋ ne mkpemkpa tetɛk, ijɔŋ tei te. Waŋa ayi ndi iyah iyi kuti ne ŋli.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Izhin bǝ nak sɔŋ shur ayi. atei gli zhin te gar amkpa ane te ambuk ne akaba. Nǝ atu muŋ atei gli zhin te gar bǝn gomnoni bǝn atum te zhin bǝ bla ikinuŋ ne atu muŋ ne ti men. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Ama atei kuti adu ilɛ didik ne ntuntun bɔbɔk ne liŋ. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Ate yi ndi ate vu zhin te gar amkpa ane te ambuk, kǝr asusun amin abɛ cɔk ala ne atu ayi iki yiŋɛ ndi izhin tei blai ba. Izhin bǝ bla iki yiŋ ndi ne nyɛ zhin ne mkpaŋa, te bai izhineba lɛ ba ayi Izhu Tsetser.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />&lt;&lt;Izumen ane nuŋ atei baŋ zumen alɛb te duŋ aŋunu, tetɛɛ atei na baŋ izu maa alɛb. Amumun atei na wɔb atetɛ amen ne akla te ŋlɔk ba. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Aneshir bɔbɔk atei kyak zhin ne atu ayi sak amuŋ, ama waŋ ndi ate kli mgbamgbaŋ atei yik ita zhɔk.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />&lt;&lt;Izhin te yik &lt;te ayak iki mimin ne amkpa waŋ ndi ba ne te ba, ine tɔ abɛ zhi, fe abaŋ ndi ayi ne ntun yi Yahudiya bɛ klu te gar igbu. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Waŋ ndi ate yi ne tu ki kǝr abɛ di wa atei zǝ te baŋ kinuŋ ne kɔb maa ba. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Waŋ ndi ate yi ne ahwaŋ kǝr abɛ di wa atei klu agar baŋ anklu ne kɔb ba. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Amba abɛ yi ne anɛ bǝn abɛ so amumun atei yik iya ne mkpaŋa. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Izhin bǝ ben Arik te kǝr iki yiŋɛ bǝ yi ne kus ba, <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />te ne bɛr yuŋɔ atei yik iya ngɔŋ ir keŋ ndi bane zen ayik ir maa ba ire mkpaŋ kaŋ ndi Arik ne na gɔnmimi, se azizaŋa, ba tei na yik ir maa ba gar klɛ tu gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Abɛ di ba Arik aduŋ ibɛre yi watsɔb ba, iner nuŋ bai bɛ lieru ba. Ama ne atu ayi abaŋ ndi Arik ne hria ba, Arik ne duŋ ibɛre bǝ te watsɔb. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Nǝ mkpaŋ yuŋɔ inuŋ ate di zhin, tɔ zhin, te Kristi me waŋ!&gt; Ka, abɛ di, &lt;Tɔ zhin, iyuŋ! Kǝr izhin bǝ tanyɛmɛ ba. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Te kristi abɛ timu bǝn abɛ bla shar yi Arik abɛ mu atei muŋ aru te na ikiki yi vuŋ anu te bǝ lɔm abaŋ ndi ne hria ba, te yi ndi tei te. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Neme izhin bǝ sɔŋ shur ayi; Mne ka bla zhin ikiki bɔbɔk andanda.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />&lt;&lt;Ama ne bɛr yuŋɔ, ne iyah ndi ne yige,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">&lt;&lt;&lt;Arik ba tei laŋ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">Ihwa ba tei na laŋ ba;<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Icinces tei zhaku rɛ gbarshu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">Ikiki yi gbarshu itei jaŋ.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />&lt;&lt;Ne mkpaŋ yuŋɔ aneshir atei yik Izu Neshir anyɛ ne akpa ne mgbyamgbyaŋ maa bǝn ngɔŋ maa. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Ankyak atei shar abɛ shar ayou Arik te tuŋ abɛ hria amaa abiŋ ire igar kɛ anzaŋ, amgbalu, ire ŋɔk li ben ŋɔk mla, ire iklɛtu gɔnmimi te gar klɛtu gbarshu.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />&lt;&lt;Azizaŋa izhin bǝ tɔ zhi nkanlɛ ire bǝn itiŋ nglǝŋglǝ: Ate yi ndi amgbavu amaa te zu te anuŋ atɔ, izhin zhi te ikus yi gbahir. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Neme, izhin te yik ikiki yiŋɛ na, izhin bǝ zhi te mkpaŋ ne te gbahir, bǝn abɛta. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Mbla zhin lɛ didik, ikab kǝŋe batei gayir ba se iki yiŋɛ ne na. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Igbarshu bǝn gɔnmimi tei gayir, ama ilɛ muŋ ba tei gayir ba.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inuŋ bane zhi iber ben mkpaŋa ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />&lt;&lt;Ba nuŋ ndi ne zhi iber bǝn mkpaŋa ba, bǝn abɛ shar ayou Arik ne Gbarshu, ka ayi Izu maa, ama anak ayi Tetɛɛ wa ankyak. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Izhin bǝ sɔŋ shur ayi! te na sɔŋ tsitsir! Inuŋ ba ne zhi mkpaŋa ba. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Iyi ndi iner nuŋ ne gar tsǝn: Nǝ duŋ kɔb maa te baŋ kɛ asak agen amaa ne aŋɔk, kɔte ŋɔwa ne ndum keŋ ndi ne nǝgu ne kǝ, te di iwaŋ ndi aklɛ ne anɔkɔŋ abɛ shur ayi.<verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />&lt;&lt;Neme izhin bǝ sɔŋ shur ayi te ba nuŋ ne zhi mkpaŋ keŋ ndi akiki ne kɔbɔ atei nyak ba, ka ayi amgbalu, ka ayi atsutsu bu, ka ayi mkpaŋ kɛ tuk agbak, ka amblimblɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ate nyɛ kpakar, kǝr izhin bǝ duŋɔ anyɛ yik zhin kukur na ba. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Iki yiŋ ndi mbla zhin, mbla kɔte ŋɔwa: &lt;Sɔŋ shur zhin ayi!&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Ne nuk Yesɔ anyɛ ne Batani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Ndi igyaŋ yi tuk glak bǝn igyaŋ yi borodi kɛ yaŋ saŋ ne dǝk bɛr yaa, ngɔŋ ne abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik bǝn abɛ tsar cɛr lɛ kɛ Musa ne zen wɔb ankɔŋ ndi aba atei vuŋ Yesɔ te aŋunu. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Fe adi, &lt;&lt;Bata te na amɛ ne mkpaŋ kɛ igyaŋa ba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kǝr aneshir abɛ lɛk mgbu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yine Batani, te asɔŋ ali kili ne tu tebur ne kɔb kɛ ner ndi azhɔu te Siman ndi ne yi amkpuk te zen li ikili, iwa nuŋ ne gli anye ane anyaŋ ndi azhɔu te albasta ane yegbo didik te anyɛ, ane nau ne inardi kɛ tsetser. Ne bu anyɛ me te bwau ashur Yesɔ ne tu.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Aner anuŋ ndi ne yine amkpama akɔ baŋ afuk tedi &lt;&lt;Ayi anii yi cɔk anye ne mgbɔ shushum awaŋa lai? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Abɛ zhi te baŋ anye awaŋa alɛb ne azɔb ayi mla ya ihwa kɛ se zhiin te nek abɛ iyah azɔbɔ.&gt;&gt; Fe akɔ vǝu ŋgɔŋ.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Yesɔ adi ba &lt;&lt;Duŋ zhin newu&gt;&gt; Susun min cɔkla te nii? Ne naam iki didik. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Izhin yi ndɔ ben abɛ iyah kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ, izhin ibǝ dik nǝk ba kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ. atei nga ba zhin te yi ndɔ ben abɛm kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ ba. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Ne na iki ndi mgbyamgbyaŋ maa ne nǝgu. Ne abaŋ anye ane mgbo shushum anuk me ne kpa te abɛ na kpa muŋ aŋyak agar bɛr iyi rum. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Mbla zhin izub, Ne amkpa awaŋ ndi ate bla ilɛ didik kǝŋe ne gɔnmimi, atei bla ki yiŋ ndi iwa waŋa ne anai, iki yi shuzhi.<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Fe Yahuda Iskariyɔti, izhin ne miŋ kɛ awur ane yaa ma, akɔ lu agar ben ngɔŋ ne abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik te wa abɛ baŋ Yesɔ alɛb ba. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ikime ne nek ba nyer ne miŋ asusun amen tetɛk te akɔ kpa anyak te di aba atei nǝgu azɔb. Fe Yahuda azǝn wɔb alɛla ndi wa atei vuŋu anǝk ba.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne ikili iyi bɛr tuk glak ben abɛ zeu tsin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Nǝ bɛr yi kuti yi igyaŋ yi borodi kɛ yaŋ saŋ, ndi mkpaŋ kɛ tsik baŋ ne nklu ne yak ne te, abɛ tsene maa aribu tedi &lt;&lt;Udi te tabǝ gar nau amkpa ane li kili yi igyaŋ yi tuk glak neme?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Fe akɔ shar abɛ tsene maa ayaa, adi ba tedi, &lt;&lt;Tsǝn te yir zhin miŋ ntuno, izhin tei yik ner nuŋ ndi ahru mkpalɛn amashir. Zǝ zhin ne wu. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Ndi iner ne kɔbɔ ate yir, &lt;Ine Tsar arib: iki kɛ ta cen imuŋɔ iyi neme, keŋ ndi M tei li igyaŋ yi tuk glak bǝn abɛ zǝm tsen?&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />atei tsar zhin iki adǝdak ngɔŋ, keŋ ndi neka nakǝ anyak. kɔte na zhin ta ikili yi tuk glak amɔ,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Abɛ tsene maa akɔ kɔmɔ, te gar ayir ntuno te yik ikiki me anenen ndi Yesɔ ne naga abla bama. Fe akɔ gar ana ikili aŋyak yi li ne igyaŋ yi tuk glak.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Ndi amgbalu ne te, Yesɔ ben abɛ zeu tsin awur ane yaa ne nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Ndi Yesɔ asɔŋ azǝn li kili ne tu tebur, adi ba tedi, &lt;&lt;Mbla zhin izub, izhiin ne miŋ min atei baŋ me alɛb, waŋ ndi asɔŋ ali ne agbǝgba azhin ben abɛm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Asusun amene ne cɔkla, fe akɔ rib Yesɔ ne akpa amen azhi zhiin te di, &lt;&lt;Ayi ngai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Ayi zhiin ne miŋ kɛ awur ane yaa ma,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi asɔŋ afa borodi ne miŋ agbǝgba azhin ben abɛm. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Izu Neshir atei kɔmɔ ir keŋ ndi ne men acɛr ne atu maa. Zhin zhɔk tu mi ner waŋ ndi atei baŋ Izu Neshir alɛb! Ibǝ rɛ ndi bane aŋliu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ndi azǝn li kili Yesɔ akɔ baŋ Borodi, te akɔ nyer te amun kɛ, te nek abɛ zeu tsǝn, te di, &lt;&lt;Ta zhin; waŋa ayi kpa muŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Fe akɔ na baŋ kpar antse me, te nyɛr te nab kɛ anǝk ba, akɔ ta kɛ so bɔbɔk mǝne.<verse eid="MRK 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yesɔ adi ba Waŋa ayi azhizhi amuŋ ane kpa nyak, awaŋ ndi ne bwau ashur ne atu aneshir tetɛk,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />&lt;&lt;Mbla zhin izub, Bam tei na nsɔ ama dɔ nkunkun iyiŋɛ ba ikam gar bɛr yiŋ ndi M tei sɔi yayas ne kɔb Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ndi ne duk asem aklɛ, akɔ ru akɔmɔ ne Gbu Zetun.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne mǝne bla te Biturus atei tun zhi wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Bɔbɔk mine izhin tei klu ŋar,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ne cɛr tedi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">&lt;&lt;&lt;M tei ŋun ine kyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">Awanta maa atei klu aŋar.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ndi mte lu ne beh, M tei nkuti min te yir Galili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Biturus adiu, &lt;&lt;kɔ nkime ate klu aŋar bɔbɔk, Nga bam tei nduŋu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />&lt;&lt;Mbla zhin izub,&gt;&gt; Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Aliŋ mdi ne buu yiŋɛ utei tun zhim amkpaŋ atar te agbak abɛ shi atuk amkpaŋ ayaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Fena Biturus atsekli te di, &lt;&lt;kɔte yi ndi M tei nku ndɔ ben abɔu, bam ntei kyagu ba.&gt;&gt; Bɔbɔk mǝne anaga na bla nkan zhin yiŋɛ<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne ben Arik ne Getsemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Ne kɔmɔ ne amkpa awaŋ ndi azhɔu te Getsemani, fe Yesɔ adi abɛ tsene maa, &lt;&lt;Zisɔŋ zhin yaŋa tem gar ben Arik.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Ne vu ane Biturus, Yakubu bǝn Yɔɔna ndɔ bǝn abɔu, fe susun maa ne lɛnu tena cɔkla tetɛk.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Adi ba. &lt;&lt;Susun muŋ ne cɔkla tetɛk gar yir ankɔŋ ane ku, sɔŋ zhin yaŋa te shur zhin ayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Ate naga atib akɔmɔ akɔ zhaku ne mimi te ben Arik te di ibǝ rɛ ndi mkpaŋ kǝŋe bǝ gar kam wa. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />adi, &lt;&lt;Abba, Tetɛɛ,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Une zhi na kɔte nii. Baŋ kpar antse kǝŋe igli tibma. Ba yi ina muŋ ba, duŋǝ bɛ yi na mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ate kam anyɛ bǝn abɛ tsene maa anyɛ yik ba akɔ kurna. &lt;&lt;Siman,&gt;&gt; adi Biturus, &lt;&lt;Izhin nak kukur nai? Ba zhin tak zhi sɔŋ tsitsir yir mkpaŋ zhin kai? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Shur zhin ayi te ben zhin Arik ndi ba zhin tei zhaku ne iten mimin ba. Min susun ne tanyɛmɛ, ikpa maa kɛ kyak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Yesɔ ana kama kɔmɔ te agar ben Arik ir yuŋɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ate kama nyɛ, anyɛ yik ba azǝn kurna, te ina ne shak ba kpa. Bane zhi diu ikinuŋ ba.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ate kama nyak mkpaŋ kɛ ntar, adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin rǝ kukur na bǝn kur sik? Nǝ mla amɛ! Mkpaŋa ne ka nyɛ. Tɔ zhin, ne baŋ Izu Neshir asak ne aŋɔk aner amimin. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Lu zhin! Te tabǝ kɔmɔ!&gt;&gt; Tɔ ne baŋ me lɛbɛ waŋ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝ vuŋ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Ayi ne miŋ kɛ zen lɛ, Yahuda, izhiin ne min kɛ awur ane yaa ma, akɔ nyɛ. Ntsan aneshir ne yi bǝn abɔu ne hru nzinzigba bǝn amkpogoki, abaŋ ndi ngɔŋ ne abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik, abɛ tsar Atɔra ben Anunkub ne shar ba.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Waŋ ndi atei baŋu alɛbɛ ne ka men bla ba ir keŋ ndi atei vuŋu: &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi M tei vuŋu nku asa amuŋ ayi wa; vuŋ zhi ne wu te Gli zhi ne wu te tabǝ tsǝn ndɔ ben abɛ blɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ate nak anyɛ gbur akli ne ti kɛ Yesɔ, Yahuda akɔ diu, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar!&gt;&gt; Te akɔ vuŋu aku ne asa maa. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Aneshire akɔ kum Yesɔ avuŋ te akpau. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Ner nuŋ ndi aklɛkli anyaŋ ba akɔ tun anzigba amaa te atsɔm tɔŋ kɛ igen ngɔŋ ne abɛ na ndum ne akaba, akyaŋ.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Nga myi ngɔŋ ayou aner amimin ndi izhin hru nzinzigba ben amkpogoki te izhin bǝ nyɛ vuŋ mei? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Nga mne yi ndɔ bǝn abɛ zhin kɔte bɛr tayi, te zen tsar ne Akabakɔŋ, izhin ne kyak vuŋ me ma. Tǝ ilɛ Arik bǝ shaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />kɔte ŋɔwa aklu te duŋu.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Ivǝnenzak nuŋ, ndi ne su anklu akɛ min ankyak, ne zǝ Yesɔ. Ndi ne komo avuŋ, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />ne klu yaŋ anklu, te duŋ anklu amaa.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne ti kɛ angɔŋgɔŋ aneshir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Ne baŋ Yesɔ te kɔmɔ bǝn ngɔŋ ne na ndum kǝ Arik, ne amkpa awaŋ ndi angɔngɔŋ abɛ na ndum Arik, anunkub ben abɛ tsar Atɔra ne nyɛ biŋ atu. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Biturus ne zeu shashan, te aklɛkli ne anɔkɔŋ amkpa ane te ambuk ayou ngɔŋ ne abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik. Tǝ azǝ asɔŋ amɔ ndɔ ben abɛ blɛ te sɔŋ azǝn vli lu.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Angɔngɔŋ abɛ na ndum Arik bǝn bɔbɔk abɛ amkpa ne te ambuk awɔb nkan lɛ yiŋ ndi aba atei vuŋǝ agli ne tu ayi Yesɔ te aba bǝ aŋunu, bane yik nkan nuŋ ba. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Aner tetɛk ne timu asagu, lǝlɛ mǝne nak tsǝn kaŋkaŋ.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Fe anuŋ akɔ lu aklɛ te timu yiŋɛ asagu: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />&lt;&lt;Tane wɔu udi, &lt;M tei ntsǝk akabakɔŋ ane me ne aŋɔk awaŋa ŋar te me anuŋ ne min kɛ bɛr tar, awaŋ ndi aba ne meu ne aŋɔk ba.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />kɔte amɛ ma lǝlɛ mǝne itsin kaŋkaŋ.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Fe ngɔŋ ne abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik alu aklɛ ne min mǝne te rib Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Bau bu anu te lɛ ka? Anii aner abaŋa azǝn blai ne atu ami?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Fe Yesɔ aku anu te akyak ilɛmɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Ngɔŋ ne abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik ana ribbu, &lt;&lt;Iwa uyi Kristi mei, Izu Arik ne ta anu adidik yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Ayi nga. Izhin tei yik Izu Neshir akɔsɔŋ ne ŋɔk li kɛ Ngɔŋ te anyɛ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ne akpa ayi gbarshu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Ngɔŋ ne abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik akɔ gbu anklu maa aŋa. Arib ba. &lt;&lt;Ta na wɔb ilɛ takɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />&lt;&lt;Izhin nak wɔb cɔk sak kɛ Arik la. Izhin yik kikin?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Bɔbɔk mǝne adiu ne mla ne ŋuu. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Anuŋ akɔ ruk ante ashuru; te ku amacincii, te shuru ante, te mligu tsik tedi &lt;&lt;Bla ta iki yi ti!&gt;&gt; Fe abɛ blɛ agbaŋu te tsǝgu.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturus ne tun zhi Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Ndi Biturus akɔ sɔŋ ne shin kɛ amkpa ne te ambuk, iVen wa nuŋ ndi are bǝn ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik anyɛ agbur aklɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Ate yik Biturus azǝn sɔŋ vli lu, akɔ shuru ayi par.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:67">Adiu, Uwa ma uyi ndɔ ben awɔnǝ Nazara, Yesɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Biturus akɔ tun zhiu ma tedi &lt;&lt;Bam ne zhi iki yi bla mi yiŋɛ ba,&gt;&gt; te akɔ ru agar anɔkɔŋ. Ankyak agbak atuk.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Ndi iven wa ma te kam ayigu amɔ, akɔ bla abɛ klikli ne amkpama, &lt;&lt;Ner waŋa ayi zhiin ne miŋ mǝne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Biturus atara na tun.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Ndi mkpaŋ gayir watsɔb, abɛ klikli ne amkpama adi Biturus, &lt;&lt;Lɛ didik unak yi zhiin ne miŋ mǝne, te uyi awɔ ne Galili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Biturus akɔ gbar tu maa Arik, te ashe arim ashur ba, &lt;&lt;Bam ne zhi ner waŋ ndi zhin kɛ lǝlɛ ma ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Ankyak agbak akɔ atuk mkpaŋ kɛ yaa. Fe Biturus akɔ shu azhi nkan lɛ ndi Yesɔ ne men ablau: &lt;&lt;Utei tun zhim amkpaŋ atar te agbak abɛ tuk amkpaŋ ayaa&gt;&gt; Fe ikpa kɛ Biturus iku sik te akɔ te zhin.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Ne Gli Yesɔ agar ben Bilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Amblimblɛ bib, ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik, bǝn anunkub, ben abɛ tsar Atɔra ben bɔbɔk Abɛ te ambuk neka kpa lɛ. Nǝ kpa Yesɔ, te gliu aru agar asak Bilatus ne aŋɔk. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Bilatus aribu &lt;&lt;Ayi uwa uyi itum ayou Yahudawa mai?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;E, ubla anenen,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik agbib bu te aba abɛ vuŋu ne lǝlɛ tetɛk. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Fe Bilatus atara na rib bu, &lt;&lt;Bau lɛ kai?&gt;&gt; Bau wɔ ba alɛ mbumbur alɛ tetɛk ne atu ami ka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Yesɔ akyak sak ba ilɛmɛ, fe Bilatus akɔ vuŋ anu.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Iki yiŋ ndi anai ne mkpaŋ kɛ igyaŋa aneshir ate ben te abɛ zhɔk ba ner nuŋ ne kur ne jaru akɔ zhɔk ba anewu <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Ner nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Barabas ane kukur ne jaru ben anuŋ ndi ne aŋlɔk aneshir. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Ntsan aneshir anyɛ te di Bilatus abɛ na aba iki ndi abene anai. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Bilatus adi, &lt;&lt;Izhin di mbǝ nzhɔk zhin itum ane Yahudawa waŋai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Ne men azhi tedi ngɔŋ ne abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik ne ka men baŋ Yesɔ asak wa ne aŋɔk te ate ankiki. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Fe ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik akɔ shɔk aneshir te abɛ di Bilatus abɛ zhɔk Barabas<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Bilatus arib ba. &lt;&lt;Nga mna kikin, ben waŋ ndi izhin zhɔu te itum ane Yahudawa ma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Ate ahwa, Kpaŋ zhi ne wu ne nkunkun!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Bilatus arib ba, &lt;&lt;Tei ni? Ne lalɛ anii?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Atana te ahwa, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋ zhin ne wu ne nkunkun kɛ gen!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Bilatus akɔ zhɔk ba Barabas te wa abɛ sik ntsan aneshire asusun. Akɔ duŋ ashur Yesɔ tsik, te avuŋu anab anǝk ba abɛ akpaŋu ne nkunkun kɛ gen.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛ kpaakpa ne mlak Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Abɛ kpaakpa ma akɔ vuŋ Yesɔ te kɔmɔ ne amkpa ane te ambuk ne akaba ayou itum te zhɔ bɔbɔk abɛ kpaakpa abiŋ amkpa azhiin. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Akɔ baŋ anklu alɛlɛ didilim ake su itum asuu, tena nyɛn itu anku kɛ ncoŋ te abaŋ kɛ asuu nǝ tu. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Tǝ akɔ agbaru asak ayi nyak, &lt;&lt;Tɔ zhin itum anǝ Yahudawa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Te klɛ te zen mligu tsik nǝ mkpɔki nǝ tu. Te tar agbarum te agbaru asak ayi mu. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ndi ne zhabu aklɛ, fe akɔ tun anklu didilim te kam anklu amaa asuu. Fe akɔ gliu te kɔmɔ ne amkpa ane kpaŋu ne nkunkun kɛ gen.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne kpaŋ Yesɔ ne kuŋkun kɛ gen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Awɔ ne Kurane, Siman, Tetɛɛ ma Alikzanda ben Rufus, ne agar atsǝn are min ntun, Akɔ sagu ne mgbyamgbyaŋ abɛ baŋ mkpɔk nkunkun kǝ gen kǝ Yesɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Agli Yesɔ te nyɛ amkpa ndi azhɔu te Golgota (amkpa ne akpukpotu). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Fe akɔ nǝgu amashir mwamwaŋ ben anǝlik, akyak sou. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Akɔ kpaŋu ne nkunkun kɛ gen. Te vu iki yi su maa gbuŋa agab, te ashur ankeŋkam te kɔte tawa abɛ zhi iki ndi iwa atei baŋ. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ne kpaŋu ne nkunkun kɛ gen ne kab arik. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ne cɛr lalɛ ma akpaŋ ne nkunkunɔ tedi: &lt;&lt;WAŊA AYI ITUM ANE YAHUDAWA.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Ne na kpaŋ abɛ zhib ayaa ndɔ ben abɔu, izhiin ni ŋɔk li maa, inuŋ ne ŋɔk mla maa. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Ilɛ kɛ Arik ne shaga <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Aner abǝ gayir agar alɛ ne atu amaa, te azhaŋ atu amen yenu tedi, &lt;&lt;Haha! Iwa ndi udi utei zir akabakɔŋ te meu ne min kɛ bɛr tar, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />ta tu mi zhɔk zi rɛ mkpɔk nkunkun kǝ gen!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik bǝn abɛ tsar Atɔra azhabu ne akpa mɛn tedi &lt;&lt;ne ta anuŋ azhɔk,&gt;&gt; te di, &lt;&lt;ama ba azhi ta tu ma zhɔk ba! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Duŋ zhin Kristi waŋa, Itum ne Isrela, zi rɛ mkpɔk nkunkun kǝ gen azizaŋa, te tabǝ yik te tanyɛmɛ.&gt;&gt; Abaŋ ndi ne kpaŋ ba ndɔmɔ ne zhabu tetɛk imenyi.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iku kɛ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Ndi kab anzaŋ ne te akpa ne te bu gar yir kab arik. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ndi arik ne kam aden Yesɔ azhɔk zhin tedi, &lt;&lt;Elɔi, Elɔi, Lama sabaktani?&gt;&gt; Ndi adi, Arik amuŋ, Arik amuŋ, aye nii duŋu kam goŋ nǝm?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Aner anuŋ ndi aklɛkli ne amkpama awɔ, tedi, &lt;&lt;Wɔ zhin, azho Iliya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Ner nuŋ akɔ klu, agar abaŋ sɔsɔ asu ne amashir mwamwaŋ, te asuu ne tu mkpɔki, te anab anǝk Yesɔ tei abɛ so. Adi, &lt;&lt;Duŋ zhin newu. Tǝ tab tɔ ka Iliya atei nyɛ abaŋu agli azime.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yesɔ aŋar kɔr te zhin, te zhɔk vli ma.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Mple anklu kɛ akabakɔŋ ne gbuŋa amplɛ aya rɛ tu gar shin. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Ndi ngɔŋ ne abɛ kpaakpa, aklikla ne ti kɛ Yesɔ, awɔ zhine te yik ndi azǝn gbaŋ iku, adi, &lt;&lt;Ner waŋa ai Izu Arik ilɛ didige!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Amba anuŋ aklɛkli shaan te zen klɔtɔ. Ne min mǝne ayi Meryamu Magadaliya, Meryamu iya maa Yakubu ambusher ben Yusuu, bǝn Solɔmi. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Amba abaŋa ne zǝ Yesɔ atsǝn are Galili tena bǝn lɔgu ma. Amba anuŋ tetɛk abaŋ ndi ne zeu are Urshelima ayi ne amkpama.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne ruu Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Ndi bɛr ŋan itei nyɛ iber yi sɔŋ sik. Amgbalu ne te <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yusuu ne Arimatiya, ngɔŋ neshir ne min mǝne, uwa maayi azǝn ŋub nyɛ kɔb Arik, ne gar ben Bilatus te abenu abɛ neg wa ikum kɛ Yesɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Ikime ne nek Bilatus vuŋ anu ndi ne wɔ tedi Yesɔ neka ku. Azhɔ ngɔŋ ne abɛ kpaakpa te ribu ka Yesɔ ne men aku rɛ kukub. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Ndi ne awɔ are ben ngɔŋ ne abɛ kpaakpa ma tedi iyi amɛ, akɔ nek Yusuu ikumɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yusuu akɔ lɛb mplɛ anklu klikla, abaŋ ikumɔ aglɛ zǝme, te nyɛn kɛ aku ne anklu aklikla, te zhɔk kɛ ne min bɛ ndi ne ka kɛ ne min nkpaŋ. Tǝ atur nkpaŋ aku anu bɛmɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Meryamu Magadaliya ben Meryamu iya maa Yusuu ne yik amkpa ndi ne ruu ma.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yesɔ ne lu ne beh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Ndi bɛr yi sɔŋ sik ne gayir, Meryamu Magadaliya, bǝn Meryamu iya maa Yakubu, bǝn Solɔmi, ne lɛb anyɛ ne ye mgbɔ shushum, te ba abɛ kɔte kin ikum Yesɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Ne amblimblɛ bib bɛr yi sɔŋ sik, ndi anzaŋ asɔŋɔ ru, te sɔŋ agar ibɛmɛ <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />te rib atu amen te di, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔwa atei ŋli ta nkpaŋ atibe ne anu bɛmɛi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ama ndi ne lɛk ayi atɔ ibǝ me, te yik nkpaŋ, yiŋ ndi iyi ngɔŋ, ne ŋlǝi agli atibe. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ndi ne yir min ibɛmɛ, ne yik ivǝnenzak nuŋ akɔ sɔŋ asu nklunklu klikla, te akɔ sɔŋ ne ŋɔk li, ankyak ate sǝsǝk.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Ivǝnenzak ga adi ba, &lt;&lt;kǝr zhin bǝ te sǝsǝk ba, izhin wɔb Yesɔ waŋ ndi ayi awɔnǝ Nazara, waŋ ndi ne kpaŋu ne kuŋkun. Nǝ ka lu! Ba yi ame ayaŋa ba. Tɔ zhin amkpa awaŋ ndi ne zhɔ gu ma. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ama izhin bǝ kam kɔmɔ, te kɔte bla abɛ tsene maa bǝn Biturus, &lt;atei kuu zhin ti te gar Galili. Izhin tei yigu amɔ, ir keŋ ndi ne bla zhine.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Neme ne ri kpa bǝn sisik, amba ma ne ru ne bɛ kǝ Yesɔ ne tanyɛmɛ te klu akɔmɔ. Bane bla Biturus ka anuŋ ikinuŋ ba, te ate sisik.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne amunoruu Meryamu Magadaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Ndi Yesɔ ne lu amblimblɛ ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik, ne muno ruu Meryamu Magadaliya, iwaŋ ndi ne Gli anerim amɛ taŋgba aglɛ rumɔ ne kpa maa. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Meryamu Magadaliya agar te te bla abaŋ ndi ne men yi ben Yesɔ ndi azǝn lɛn susun te na zhiin. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ndi ne wɔ te Yesɔ ayime tsitsir te nena yigu, ba ne tanyɛmɛ ba.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne munoru anere ayaa abɛ zeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Neme Yesɔ ne na munoru ne nkuŋkɔŋ tetɛk ben aneshir ayaa ne min mǝne ndi ne tsǝtsene kɔmɔ ne ntun. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Nǝ kɔmɔ te kɔte bla anki mǝne; ama bane tanyɛmɛ ba.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne munoru anere awur ane ayaa abɛ zeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Nǝ gɔgɔŋ Yesɔ ne muno ruu awur ane zhin ndi ne zen li ikili; Ne gbaŋ ba atɔŋ ne yaŋ tanyɛmɛ men bǝn klik atu yi yaŋ tanyɛmɛ bǝn abaŋ ndi ne yik wa ndi wa ne lu.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Adi ba, &lt;&lt;kɔmɔ zhin ne gɔnmimi te du zhin ilɛ didik kǝ men bǝn aneshir bɔbɔk. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Iwaŋ ndi ate tanyɛmɛ te na duŋ asu atei lieru, ama iwaŋ ndi ba ne tanyɛmɛ ba atei ŋunu. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Ngir kǝŋe tei yi ben abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ: atei gli anerim arumɔ ne sak muŋ; atei lɛ ne aŋa yayas; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />atei baŋ ane wa ne aŋɔk amen; atei so kǝka kɛ ku, ba tei na ba iki mimin ba, atei sak aner abɛ lɔ aŋɔk te duŋ ba are.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne baŋ Yesɔ te kɔmɔ ne shu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Ndi Yesɔ Ngɔŋ ne lɛ ben abɛba, Arik ne baŋu te kɔmɔ ne gbarshu te akɔ sɔŋ ne ŋɔk li maa. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Ankyak abɛ tsin abɛ Yesɔ aru te kɔte du lɛ kɛ men didik kɔte me, Arik ne tsǝn bǝn abɛba te duŋ lɛ kɛ bla maa bǝ shaga ne na ikiki yi vuŋ anu.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>